{"_id":"0A4zIeprB97DB8lh","name":"Dark Bully","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:dark-bully","level":8,"monsterType":"Daemon","intelligence":"Average","perception":"Five senses (Darkvision)","disposition":"Hostile","soulscars":0,"languages":"Daemonic","habitat":"Labyrinths, Ruins","reputation":15,"weakness":18,"weakPoint":"Fire damage +3 points","initiative":15,"movementSpeed":"20","fortitude":"11 (18)","willpower":"10 (17)","source":"CR II p. 405","description":"Standing at 2m tall, the Dark Bully appears entirely in shadow. A long claw grows from each hand instead of fingers, giving the appearance of the scythes of the god of death. It also has a powerful Continuous Attack unique skill and is recognized as a fearsome assassin.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"◯ Continuous Attack II","description":"If a Dark Bully successfully hits a target in melee, they may make a second attack. They can make a third attack against the same target if a second attack hits."},{"title":"◯ Fatigue Poison/9 (16)/Fortitude/Negates","description":"If a Claw attack deals at least 1 point of applied damage, the target's Evasion is reduced by a -1. This effect is Poison type and lasts for 1 hour. It is cumulative if the same effect is applied within the duration."},{"title":"◯ Shadow Cross","description":"During a Normal Move, it temporarily disappears and appears from within any shadow at the destination. In the absence of light, it can appear from anywhere in the darkness.\nIt does not suffer any movement blocking and is free to leave the skirmish.\nThis ability cannot be used in consecutive turns.\n2d |\nLoot |\nAlways |\nDaemon's Blood (100G/Red A) |\n2 - 7 |\nNothing |\n8+ |\nCrystallized Daemon's Blood (800G/Red A) |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Dark Bully","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":100000}
{"_id":"0TQ4faX1nSz0Yboq","name":"Quezardus","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:quezardus","level":8,"monsterType":"Daemon","intelligence":"Average","perception":"Five Senses (Darkvision)","disposition":"Hostile","soulscars":0,"languages":"Daemonic","habitat":"Underground Labyrinth, Ruins","reputation":16,"weakness":18,"weakPoint":"Bludgeoning Damage +3","initiative":13,"movementSpeed":"15/-","fortitude":"10 (17)","willpower":"11 (18)","source":"BM","description":"A humanoid-like Daemon with a lanky body shape. The front of the body has numerous razor-like openings, and numerous tentacles sprout from the back. Glistening organs similar to a mako stone peek out from the apertures in the body and from the tips of the tentacles.\n\nThese organs have the ability to absorb and distribute the MP received to others, and this daemon is also called the \"Supply Soldier of Daemon World\".","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"◯ Magic Damage Halved","description":"If this monster is subjected to magic damage, the total damage is first halved; if it is halved by resistance, it becomes 0.\nThis unique skill does not affect anything except damage - Effects will still happen based on the result of the resistance check."},{"title":"◯ MP Absorption","description":"If the Quezardus becomes a target of a spell, it restores its own MP for the magic's base MP cost.\nThis effect appears only when the Quezardus is targeted by a spell cast at it and does not affect similar but non-magical abilities or effects performed from items. Even if the MP cost of the caster who cast the spell is increased or decreased by various abilities or effects, the MP recovered by this monster is calculated based on the base MP cost. Also, whether the spell is friendly or hostile and whether or not the resistance to the magic was made should not be taken into account."},{"title":"⏩ MP Transfer/Optional","description":"The Quezardus transfers any amount of its MP to \"Target: 1 Character\" within \"Range/Area: 1 (10m) / Shot .\" The number of MP that can be transferred is an arbitrary number from 1 to its current MP. The Quezardus receives fixed damage to its MP and the target's MP is restored by the amount of the MP.\n2d |\nLoot |\nAlways |\nDaemon's Blood (100G/Red A) |\n2 - 8 |\nNothing |\n9 - 11 |\nMako Stone (5 pts.) (250G/-) |\n12+ |\nMako Stone (10 pts.) (1,000G/-) |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Quezardus","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":200000}
{"_id":"0vej1dELyD0LytDj","name":"Terror Beast","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:terror-beast","level":8,"monsterType":"Daemon","intelligence":"Low","perception":"Five senses","disposition":"Hostile","soulscars":0,"languages":"Daemonic","habitat":"Labyrinths, Ruins","reputation":14,"weakness":18,"weakPoint":"Energy damage +3 points","initiative":15,"movementSpeed":"22 (4 Legs)","fortitude":"11 (18)","willpower":"10 (17)","source":"CR III p. 417","description":"The Terror Beasts are considered the higher form of Aetherbeasts .\n\nIt is about the size of a cow and four-legged, but it has a horrifying and bizarre appearance, and its body is constantly decomposing and regenerating. It emits an unpleasant odor, and those who see it can be weakened by fear.\n\nThey often follow other daemons and are known to act in groups. Their fangs are poisonous, and those that are bitten will surely die as their bodies slowly rot.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"◯ Poison Immunity, ◯ Disease Immunity","description":""},{"title":"► Divine Magic 4 Level/Magic Power 6 (13)","description":""},{"title":"🗨 Magic Aptitude","description":"A Terror Beast can use the Combat Feats [ Multi-Action ] and [ Metamagic/Targets ]."},{"title":"◯ Dreadful/9 (16)/Willpower/Negates","description":"Anyone who sees the Terror Beast receives a -2 penalty to all Skill Checks due to fear for 10 seconds (1 round). A Willpower check against this effect must be made at the beginning of each character's turn. This effect is Psychic type."},{"title":"◯ Corrosive Poison/11 (18)/Fortitude/Negates","description":"The target is poisoned if the Bite attack deals at least 1 point of applied damage.\nA poisoned character immediately suffers 2d-5 Poison magic damage (minimum 0) and continues to suffer the same damage on each of its turns (no Fortitude check is needed). This effect lasts as long as it is not cured but is not cumulative."},{"title":"◯ Regeneration = 10 points","description":"At the end of each round, the Terror Beast recovers 10 HP. This has no effect if Terror Beast has 0 HP or lower.\n2d |\nLoot |\nAlways |\nDaemon's Blood (100G/Red A) |\nAlways |\nDaemon's Fangs (300G/Red A) |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Terror Beast","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":400000}
{"_id":"3a4oc1idRSBq9OMf","name":"Wafushu","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:wafushu","level":7,"monsterType":"Daemon","intelligence":"Average","perception":"Five Senses (Darkvision)","disposition":"Hostile","soulscars":0,"languages":"Daemonic","habitat":"Ruins, Shallows","reputation":15,"weakness":19,"weakPoint":"Physical Damage +2","initiative":15,"movementSpeed":"20 (4 Legs)/-","fortitude":"10 (17)","willpower":"9 (16)","source":"GR, Battle Mastery p. 149","description":"A Daemon shaped like a wolf, with black spike-like protrusions growing from its entire body. They are about 3m in length and stand 1m and 50 cm tall at the shoulder. Brutal and cunning in battle, they strike with great agility and can enlarge the spikes that grow from their body.\n\nTheir special ability, [Hound's Scent] is easier to handle, if the individuals keep track of who is struck by their attacks.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"◯ Hound's Scent","description":"A Wafushu relentlessly pursues prey, much like a hunting dog. If it successfully hits with a Bite attack, it gains a +1 bonus to Accuracy checks against the target for 3 minutes (18 rounds), as well as a +1 bonus to Evasion checks against attacks made by the target."},{"title":"◯ Abrasive Spikes","description":"Merely brushing against the Wafushu's spiky protrusions causes damage. Any target of the Wafushu's Bite attack suffers 4 points of fixed damage, whether or not the attack is successful.\n2d |\nLoot |\nAlways |\nDaemon's Blood (100G/Red A) |\n2 - 9 |\nBlack Spike (440G/Red A) |\n10+ |\nJet Black Spike (990G/Red A) |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Wafushu","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":700000}
{"_id":"4XJZHBPgcGgkGzJE","name":"Tiki Tiki","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:tiki-tiki","level":13,"monsterType":"Daemon","intelligence":"High","perception":"Five Senses (Darkvision)","disposition":"Hostile","soulscars":0,"languages":"Daemonic","habitat":"Underground Labyrinth, Ruins","reputation":17,"weakness":22,"weakPoint":"Physical Damage +2","initiative":20,"movementSpeed":"-/50 (Flying)","fortitude":"16 (23)","willpower":"18 (25)","source":"BM","description":"The Tiki Tiki Daemon is actually a multitude of smaller Tikiras that move in concert as a single creature. The combined Tiki Tiki has the appearance of a human-sized Tikira. All Tikira in the colony share both thoughts and perceptions.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"► Divine Magic 12 Level/Magic Power 16 (23)","description":""},{"title":"► Paradox","description":"The Tiki Tiki can cause spells that would recover HP to deal Magic damage instead by spending twice as much MP to cast those spells."},{"title":"🗨 ► Magic Aptitude","description":"They can use the Combat Feats [ Multi-Action ], [ Universal Metamagic ], and [ Wordbreak ]."},{"title":"◯ Flight","description":"Receives a +1 bonus to Accuracy and Evasion only for melee attacks."},{"title":"◯ Mockery","description":"The Tiki Tiki finds failure hilarious and will begin uncontrollably laughing when anyone, friend, or foe, Automatically Fails on a roll. While laughing, the Tikira cannot use magic until the end of their next turn."},{"title":"◯ Super Unluck","description":"In battles where the Tiki Tiki is present, when any character, friend or foe, other than the Tiki Tiki rolls double 6's, that roll gets changed to double 1's instead (which triggers the Tiki Tiki's [ ◯ Mockery] unique skill). It is possible to change the roll back to double 6s using [ Sword's Grace/Change Fate ]. This ability is not triggered if double 1s are changed to double 6s using [Sword's Grace/Change Fate] normally."},{"title":"⏩ Split/Reform","description":"The Tiki Tiki can split itself into a swarm of smaller Daemons or reform into one large Daemon. When split, the Tiki Tiki cannot make melee attacks or cast spells but gains the [ ◯ Swarm] unique skill. If the effect of [ ◯ Mockery] is active, the ability [ ► Destructive Cacophony] is also triggered. Splitting or Reforming requires a Minor Action, but the Tiki Tiki cannot Split and Reform during the same turn."},{"title":"◯ Swarm","description":"This unique skill is only available when the Tiki Tiki has used [ ⏩ Split/Reform] to become a group of smaller Daemons. When targeting the Tiki Tiki or another character in the Tiki Tiki's skirmish area, the Combat Feats [ Targeting ] and [ Magic Control ] cannot be used."},{"title":"► Destructive Cacophony / 20 (27) / Fortitude / Negates","description":"This ability can only be used when [ ◯ Mockery] is active and when the Tiki Tiki has split itself into a group using [ ⏩ Split/Reform].\nThe Tiki Tiki surrounds a \"Target: 1 Character\" within \"Range: Touch\" and bombards them with loud laughter. The target receives 2d+16 of Bludgeoning magic damage and is unable to declare Combat Feats for 10 seconds (1 round).\n2d |\nLoot |\nAlways |\nCrystallized Daemon's Blood (800G/Red A) |\nAlways |\nDaemon Wings (350G/Red A) x 2d |\n2 - 12 |\nNothing |\n13+ |\nRainbow Daemon Wings (1500G/Gold Red S) x 1d |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Tiki Tiki","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"4rfftjXaPWvbI2dg","name":"Shabalay","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:shabalay","level":9,"monsterType":"Daemon","intelligence":"Low","perception":"Magic","disposition":"Hostile","soulscars":0,"languages":"None","habitat":"Ruins, Shallow Abysses","reputation":16,"weakness":19,"weakPoint":"Energy damage +3","initiative":16,"movementSpeed":"10(Crawling)","fortitude":"13 (20)","willpower":"12 (19)","source":"DL","description":"This Daemon is a stubby, reddish-black, irregularly shaped creature with a number of small arms and legs.\n\nInstead of using its legs or feet as it should, it moves by crawling. It does not speak any language but seems to have enough intellect to understand what others say.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"◯ Amorphous Body","description":"Immune to criticals from edged weapons."},{"title":"◯ Daemonic Droplets","description":"An attack with Droplets is treated as a Shooting Attack with \"Range: 20m\". If the target is hit, the Defense is treated as half (rounded up)."},{"title":"► Red Droplets/11 (18)/Fortitude/Half","description":"Droplets begin to fly around the Shabalay.\nAll targets in the same skirmish area as the monster are dealt 2d+8 Poison magic damage. Using this effect consumes 10 points of MP.\n2d |\nLoot |\nAlways |\nCrystallized Daemon's Blood (800G/Red A) |\n2 - 11 |\nNothing |\n12+ |\nSolidified Droplets (2,500G/Red S) |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Shabalay","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":300000}
{"_id":"6uRPoBAU9iiOADfG","name":"Grunel","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:grunel","level":7,"monsterType":"Daemon","intelligence":"Average","perception":"Five senses (Darkvision)","disposition":"Hostile","soulscars":0,"languages":"Arcana, Daemonic","habitat":"Ruins","reputation":14,"weakness":19,"weakPoint":"Magic damage +2","initiative":15,"movementSpeed":"15","fortitude":"10 (17)","willpower":"10 (17)","source":"Monstrous Lore p. 204","description":"A humanoid daemon with bronze skin and a height of about 3m, Grunels have long tails that they treat like whips.\n\nSome individuals may have magic weapons as well (increasing both Accuracy and damage by +1), and with their aptitude for magic, it is assumed that the Grunel handmade this weapon. If a Grunel with a magic sword is killed, the sword is automatically looted. The GM may decide the sword's type at their own discretion.\n\nOddly enough, Grunels have been seen in the company of Grassrunners. It is not quite sure what the relationship between the two races is, and neither side is willing to talk about it. However, this has led to the rumor that Grassrunners come from another world.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"► Truespeech Magic , Divine Magic 7 Level/Magic Power 10 (17)","description":""},{"title":"◯ 🗨 Magic Aptitude","description":"They can use the Combat Feats [ Targeting ] and [ Metamagic/Targets ]."},{"title":"🗨 Mana Strike = +10 damage","description":"A Grunel may deal an additional +10 damage to their next melee attack. If they do, they receive a -2 penalty to Fortitude, and Willpower checks until their next turn.\nTail"},{"title":"◯ Entangling Tail","description":"A successful hit from a Tail entangles the target. In each round, the entangled target is hit automatically by the Tail and makes all Accuracy and Evasion Checks with a -2 penalty. This penalty is not cumulative.\nWhen the target tries to escape, use the de-bonding rules.\nWhile entangled by this unique skill, the Tail section cannot attack other characters. If the monster itself wants to release the target, it can do so with a Minor Action.\n2d |\nLoot |\nAlways |\nDaemon's Blood (100G/Red A) |\n2 - 7 |\nNothing |\n8 - 10 |\nDaemon's Earrings (260G/Gold White A) |\n11+ |\nDaemon's Bracelet (1,200G/Gold White S) |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Grunel","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":300000}
{"_id":"6vphrbs2Gs3cI6pd","name":"Abyss Minions","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:abyss-minions","level":4,"monsterType":"Daemon","intelligence":"Average","perception":"Five senses (Darkvision)","disposition":"Hostile","soulscars":0,"languages":"Daemonic","habitat":"Shallow Abysses","reputation":11,"weakness":14,"weakPoint":"Accuracy +1","initiative":11,"movementSpeed":"-/14(Flying)","fortitude":"6 (13)","willpower":"6 (13)","source":"CR III p. 413","description":"These minions are seen flying around in the sky, mainly in Shallow Abysses.\n\nThey look like two small, winged child-like Daemons connected by their long intertwined tails. The two are never separated and are therefore considered a single Daemon. Their consciousnesses seem to be completely synchronized, and their coordinated attacks are as threatening as those of a skilled swordsman with two swords.\n\nThere have been reports of seeing three or more bodies connected by a tail, but the possibility of misidentification or assumption has not been ruled out, and the information has yet to be confirmed.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"◯ Flight","description":"Abyss Minions receive a +1 bonus to Accuracy and Evasion only for melee attacks."},{"title":"◯ Twin Daemons","description":"At first glance, the Right and Left sections are indistinguishable. If the character performs a melee attack, a ranged attack, or a \"Target: 1 Character\" spell or effect on one of these sections, roll 1d. If the result is 1- 2, the opposite section, which is different from the targeted section, will be affected. If both sections are targeted at the same time, this effect does not occur.\nThis ability is lost when the HP of either Right or Left sections falls to 1 or less."},{"title":"► Cross Strike/7 (14)/Evasion/Negates","description":"It attacks 1 character with a melee attack from both sections simultaneously, dealing 2d+10 physical damage.\nThis ability cannot be used when a Major Action has been completed for either its Right or Left section. Also, if it uses this ability, the Major Action of both sections will be completed.\n2d |\nLoot |\nAlways |\nDaemon's Blood (100G/Red A) |\n2 - 9 |\nNothing |\n10+ |\nDirty Weapons (300G/Black White A) |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Abyss Minions","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":100000}
{"_id":"7SZ0yAPQxDJRi1Xd","name":"Erbirea","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:erbirea","level":3,"monsterType":"Daemon","intelligence":"Animal","perception":"Five senses","disposition":"Hostile","soulscars":0,"languages":"None","habitat":"Shallow Abysses","reputation":9,"weakness":13,"weakPoint":"Magic Damage +2 Points","initiative":8,"movementSpeed":"8","fortitude":"4 (11)","willpower":"5 (12)","source":"CR I p. 429","description":"This is a shrimp-faced daemon, spotted in and around Shallow Abysses, about the size of a Human child, with thick, short limbs and dull indigo skin.\n\nAlthough not much of a threat on their own, they can appear in large numbers at once, and often the Adventurers' Guild is asked to exterminate these monsters.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"◯ Mana-inhibiting Poison/4 (11)/Fortitude/Negates","description":"If the claw attack hits, the target's Magic Power is reduced by -1 for 10 seconds (1 round). This effect is Poison type.\n2d |\nLoot |\nAlways |\nDaemon's Blood (100G/Red A) |\n2 - 10 |\nNothing |\n11+ |\nAbyss Shard (200G/-) |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Erbirea","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":100000}
{"_id":"9N3utIIvD9f2RVeD","name":"Hapsapra Rosil","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:hapsapra-rosil","level":14,"monsterType":"Daemon","intelligence":"High","perception":"Magic","disposition":"Hostile","soulscars":0,"languages":"Trade Common, Barbaric, Youma, Drakish, Arcana, Daemonic","habitat":"Snow, Shallows","reputation":21,"weakness":24,"weakPoint":"Fire damage +3 points","initiative":21,"movementSpeed":"20/20 (Flying)","fortitude":"18(25)","willpower":"17(24)","source":"AB, p. 126","description":"Hapsapra Rosil is a Daemon with a length of about 5 meters, having thin long arms and a face like a seal with horns. On its back grows white swan wings with abundant feathers.\n\nIt wields a massive double-edged sword with both hands, manipulating it freely as if juggling, demonstrating high offensive power with swordplay that no one else can imitate.\n\nIt keenly perceives the desire for power in others with will, and suggests temporarily granting them power. In doing so, Hapsapra Rosil establishes contracts that work in its favor, taking pleasure in severely weakening the surrounding characters and causing discord among companions.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"◯Water/Ice Immunity","description":""},{"title":"◯Snow Traversal","description":"On snowy or icy terrain, it does not receive penalties for difficult footing.\nHead"},{"title":"►Magic (1 System) 14 Level / Magic Power 17(24)","description":"Has mastered one school of magic systems at level 14 from either Truespeech Magic , Spiritualism Magic , or Divine Magic (Laris) ."},{"title":"◯🗨Magic Aptitude","description":"They can use Combat Feats [ Multi-Action ], [ Targeting ], [ Metamagic/Targets ], [ Magic Convergence ], and [ Magic Control ]."},{"title":"⏩Power Temptation / 16 (23) / Willpower / Negates","description":"Within \"Range/Area: 2 (30m) / Target \", performs a temptation to grant power to \"Target: 1 Character.\"\nIf the target fails the resistance check, for 10 seconds (1 round), they can increase any one ability score of their choice by +12. While this effect changes the ability modifier, it does not affect maximum HP or MP values.\nThis ability can only be used up to twice per round and cannot be used on the same target in the same round. This effect is Curse + Psychic type and does not stack.\nUsing this ability consumes 5 MP points."},{"title":"⏩Price of Power / Can't","description":"This is a \"Range: Caster\" effect with \"Target: All Areas (30m radius) / Space.\" If there is 1 or more characters who have received the [⏩Power Temptation] effect within the area of effect, all other characters in range will receive effects from the \"Price of Power Table\" a number of times equal to the number of characters affected by [⏩Power Temptation]. All effects stack and accumulate.\nThis effect is Curse + Psychic type.\nThis ability can only be used once per round and can only be used after using [⏩Power Temptation] at least once.\nPrice of Power Table\n1d |\nDuration |\nEffect |\n1 |\nInstant |\nThe current HP value immediately decreases\nby \"2dx2\" points (determined individually) |\n2 |\n10 seconds (1 round) |\nAll Magic Powers -3 |\n3 |\n10 second (1 round) |\nAccuracy -3 |\n4 |\n10 second (1 round) |\nEvasion -3 |\n5 |\n10 second (1 round) |\nFortitude -3 |\n6 |\n10 second (1 round) |\nWillpower -3 |\nBody"},{"title":"◯Flight II","description":"Head and Body sections gain a +2 bonus to Accuracy and Evasion checks for melee attacks.\nThis ability is lost when the Body section's HP falls below 0."},{"title":"►Twin Strike &amp; Double Attack","description":"A Hapsapra Rosil can make two Double-edged Sword attacks each round, though each attack requires its Accuracy check. They may choose to attack different characters with each attack."},{"title":"◯Double Bite","description":"When a Double-edged Sword attack hits, damage dice are rolled twice and both results are applied to the target."},{"title":"►Blizzard Breath / 17 (24) / Fortitude / Half","description":"Attacks by exhaling breath from the mouth opened in the chest. Deals 2d+18 points of Water/Ice magic damage with \"Range/Area: 2 (30m) / Shot \" to \"Target: 1 area(6m radius)/20.\" When using this effect, this monster can exclude any characters within the area of effect from being targeted beforehand.\nThis ability cannot be used in consecutive turns.\n2d |\nLoot |\nAlways |\nCrystallized Great Daemon's Blood (1,600G/Red S) |\n2 - 10 |\nDaemon's Horn (600G/Red A) |\n11+ |\nLarge Daemon's Horn (1,400G/Red S) |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Hapsapra Rosil","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":100000}
{"_id":"BEJEEwFYop100Uik","name":"Sihalus","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:sihalus","level":7,"monsterType":"Daemon","intelligence":"Average","perception":"Five senses (Darkvision)","disposition":"Hostile","soulscars":0,"languages":"Arcana, Daemonic","habitat":"Ruins","reputation":15,"weakness":18,"weakPoint":"Fire damage + 3 points","initiative":14,"movementSpeed":"15 (4 Legs)","fortitude":"10 (17)","willpower":"9 (16)","source":"CR III p. 416","description":"This is a lower Daemon with a semi-transparent, reptilian-like appearance. It is about 4m long and attacks its opponent with a long bright red tongue.\n\nBecause of their ecology, they are very rare to find, and those that are found are almost without exception preyed upon.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"◯ Semi-Transparent Body","description":"The whole body is semi-transparent.\nThis monster does not create any shielding, even if it is on the battlefield. Also, it is invisible to characters in a different area (Simplified Combat) or at a distance of more than 10 meters (Standard Combat).\nHead"},{"title":"► Truespeech Magic 6 Level/Magic Power 8 (15)","description":""},{"title":"◯ 🗨 Magic Aptitude","description":"They can use the Combat Feats [ Targeting ], [ Magic Convergence ], [ Magic Control ], and [ Metamagic/Targets ].\nRight Side/Left Side"},{"title":"◯ Painful Strike","description":"If the 2d roll of the damage roll is 10 or more, the damage is increased by an additional +5 points."},{"title":"◯Attack Obstacle = +4 • +4","description":"Sihalus' giant body hinders attacks.\nThe Head section gains a +4 bonus to Evasion checks against melee and ranged attacks.\nThis effect disappears when either Right or Left Side section falls to 0 HP or lower.\nTail"},{"title":"🗨 Tail Sweep","description":"The monster can use its tail to attack up to 3 targets in the same skirmish. Accuracy check should be made once; if multiple characters are hit, damage should be determined individually.\nThis ability cannot be used on consecutive turns."},{"title":"► Curse of Translucency/9 (16)/Willpower/ Neg","description":"Within \"Range/Area: 2 (20m)/ Shot \", the monster shoots an invisible wave from the tip of the Tail at \"Target: 1 Character\". The target gains the [ ◯ Semi-Transparent Body] unique skill. This effect is permanent of a Curse type.\n2d |\nLoot |\nAlways |\nDaemon's Blood (100G/Red A) |\n2 - 9 |\nClear Jewel (200G/Gold Red A) |\n10+ |\nTransparent Crystal (500G/Gold Red A) |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Sihalus","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":500000}
{"_id":"CjHxAeEaCmsjawcg","name":"Movkira","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:movkira","level":5,"monsterType":"Daemon","intelligence":"Animal","perception":"Five senses (Darkvision)","disposition":"Hostile","soulscars":0,"languages":"None","habitat":"Ruins, Shallow Abysses","reputation":12,"weakness":16,"weakPoint":"Physical damage +2 points","initiative":12,"movementSpeed":"18(Many Legs)","fortitude":"7 (14)","willpower":"7 (14)","source":"CR III p. 414","description":"This is a spider-like Daemon with a complex purple pattern on its belly. Numerous tentacles extend from the jaws of the spider, and when connect, they drain the life of a living being. Tail needles have a poison that makes the target hallucinate.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"◯ Bloodsucking/Can't","description":"When a Tentacle attack hits, it deals 3 fixed damage to the target in addition to the normal physical damage. At the same time, Head section's HP is recovered by 3 points.\nChest"},{"title":"► Fasten with Many Legs/8 (15)/Evasion/Negates","description":"Within \"Range: Touch\" it captures \"Target: 1 Character\" with its eight legs and tightens them. The target is dealt 2d + [Chest section's HP/5 (rounded up)] physical damage.\nBelly"},{"title":"◯ Hallucinogenic Poison Needle/6 (13)/ Fortitude/Negates","description":"The target of the needle attack will hallucinate and lose their judgment. The target cannot use weapon attacks, cast spells, or other unique skills that might make any section of this monster a target, or include any section of this monster as a target, or make any section of this monster a target, even if only probable, for the next 10 seconds (1 round). If the target has multiple sections, this effect is applied to all sections.\nThis effect of Poison type.\n2d |\nLoot |\nAlways |\nDaemon's Blood (100G/Red A) |\n2 - 8 |\nNothing |\n9 - 10 |\nPoison Stinger (100G/Red A) |\n11+ |\nPoison Stinger with Intact Poison Sac (800G/Red A) |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Movkira","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":300000}
{"_id":"EL0De2HzS9TijFTt","name":"Mengle","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:mengle","level":1,"monsterType":"Daemon","intelligence":"Low","perception":"Five senses (Darkvision)","disposition":"Hostile","soulscars":0,"languages":"Trade Common, Daemonic","habitat":"Various","reputation":8,"weakness":12,"weakPoint":"Physical damage +2 points","initiative":9,"movementSpeed":"10","fortitude":"2 (9)","willpower":"2 (9)","source":"VC","description":"Mengle is a Daemon that looks like a skinny child about one meter long. Known as \"Confusing Child,\" it approaches with a hideous smile and confuses its victims by glaring at them with its red glowing eyes.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"► Eyes of Confusion/3 (10)/Willpower/Negates","description":"Mengle stares within \"Range/Area: 1 (10m)/ Target \" at \"Target: 1 Character\" and disrupts it. The opponent receives a -1 penalty on action checks for 10 seconds (1 round). Using this effect costs 2 MP.\n2d |\nLoot |\n2 - 9 |\nNothing |\n10+ |\nWeapon (30G/Black White B) |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Mengle","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"EYEz4UYQjUkGWGxX","name":"Zalbard","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:zalbard","level":6,"monsterType":"Daemon","intelligence":"Average","perception":"Five senses (Darkvision)","disposition":"Hostile","soulscars":0,"languages":"Daemonic","habitat":"Ruins, Shallow Abysses","reputation":13,"weakness":18,"weakPoint":"Accuracy +1","initiative":14,"movementSpeed":"14/20(Flying)","fortitude":"10 (17)","willpower":"9 (16)","source":"CR III p. 415","description":"This is a bright red lower Daemon with bat-like wings and big horns. It is over 3 meters tall and has flaming red eyes. It can fly with its wings on its back and sometimes attacks with fire from the sky. It is often encountered in ruins and is estimated to be one of the most frequently summoned and used Daemons during the Magic Civilization Period.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"► Divine Magic 4 Level/Magic Power 7 (14)","description":""},{"title":"◯ Flight","description":"A Zalbard receives a +1 bonus to Accuracy and Evasion only for melee attacks."},{"title":"► Flame Breath/9 (16)/Fortitude/Half","description":"A Zalbard breathes a gout of flame with \"Range/Area: 1 (10m) / Shot \" at \"Target: 1 Character\", dealing 2d+8 Fire magic damage.\n2d |\nLoot |\nAlways |\nDaemon's Blood (100G/Red A) |\n2 - 6 |\nNothing |\n7 - 8 |\nDaemon's Earrings (260G/Gold White A) |\n9+ |\nDaemon's Ring (600G/Gold White A) |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Zalbard","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":500000}
{"_id":"EjkTzkhKSLoAU1JP","name":"Doubleburg","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:doubleburg","level":6,"monsterType":"Daemon","intelligence":"Average","perception":"Five senses (Darkvision)","disposition":"Hostile","soulscars":0,"languages":"Daemonic (+languages added by shapeshift)","habitat":"Ruins, Habitats, Shallow Abysses","reputation":12,"weakness":15,"weakPoint":"Physical damage +2 points","initiative":13,"movementSpeed":"15","fortitude":"8 (15)","willpower":"8 (15)","source":"CR II p. 404","description":"This is a jet-black daemon of about the same size as a Human. The face has a red, open mouth with a straight slit, but no other visible features exist.\n\nThis monster can shapeshift into the creature it perceives, then kills it and replaces it. It often enters into Humanoid and Barbarous societies.\n\nDoubleburg's purpose is unknown, but they are said to be sent by the Daemons to learn about the intelligent life forms in the world of Raxia. They actively use their ability to transform, perhaps to advance their observations into the psychology of individuals and groups, and attempt to create doubt and confusion in cities and communities.\n\nThey are similar to Ogres and are considered more dangerous because they cannot be blocked by Swords of Protection.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"► Double Attack","description":"With the claws of both hands, it makes two attacks on 1 character. This unique skill cannot be used on a character copied by [ ► Portrait]."},{"title":"► Portrait","description":"It captures the appearance of the observed target and turns into it. If the target is only seen at a glance, its appearance and personal belongings can be matched. If the target can be perceived for 1 minute (6 rounds), it can learn its language and imitate its tone and gestures so precisely that even a close human cannot detect it. If it is taking the form of this unique skill, a Monster Knowledge check cannot be performed on it unless Detect check was made before.\nThis unique skill does not copy the target's class or unique skills. All the data during the battle will be the monster's data. Attacks made by the target's appearance are made by the monster's physical weapon (Claws), even though it looks like the target's weapon is doing them.\nA copy of a character in multiple sections appears to have the corresponding number of sections. Still, only the Main Section (or one of them in the case of multiple sections) is treated as Doubleburg. Other sections do not perform any action. If this section is targeted and attacked, the effect is automatically given to the monster. If the effect targets more than one section simultaneously, the excess will do nothing, but at the same time, it will be automatically found that the section does not exist. Detect check is needed to find the actual section.\nThe [ ► Portrait] can be ended with Minor Action or during Combat Preparation.\n2d |\nLoot |\nAlways |\nDaemon's Blood (100G/Red A) |\n2 - 12 |\nNothing |\n13+ |\nBlack Hide (4,600G/Red S) |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Doubleburg","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":100000}
{"_id":"FQJXJDecEnCrTv45","name":"Sakkara","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:sakkara","level":4,"monsterType":"Daemon","intelligence":"Animal","perception":"Magic","disposition":"Hostile","soulscars":0,"languages":"Daemonic","habitat":"Forests, Shallows","reputation":11,"weakness":15,"weakPoint":"Physical damage +2 points","initiative":12,"movementSpeed":"10 (Crawling)","fortitude":"6(13)","willpower":"6(13)","source":"AB, p. 121","description":"This is a Daemon that appears as a giant earthworm covered in earth-colored, hard diamond-shaped scales. It measures approximately 3 meters in length, with a body diameter of about 50 centimeters.\n\nIt favors terrain that other creatures avoid, such as sludge and swamps, and often digs up and expands the surrounding area. There have been reported sightings of Shallow Abysses in these expanded territories, suggesting a connection with this Daemon.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"►Mud Spit / 5 (12) / Fortitude / Half","description":"Within \"Range/Area: 1 (10m) / Shot \", spits mud to attack 1 target character. The target takes 2d+1 points of Earth magic damage.\nWithin a Shallow Abyss, damage increases by 2 points and the type becomes \"Earth and Poison.\"\nThis ability cannot be used in consecutive turns."},{"title":"◯Razor Scales","description":"When a Slam attack hits, it deals 1 point of fixed damage to the target in addition to the applied damage.\n2d |\nLoot |\nAlways |\nDaemon's Blood (100G/Red A) |\n2 - 9 |\nNothing |\n10+ |\nDaemon's Blood (100G/Red A) |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Sakkara","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":300000}
{"_id":"Hro7TznYNat7Hlfd","name":"Sevaseva","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:sevaseva","level":8,"monsterType":"Daemon","intelligence":"High","perception":"Magic","disposition":"Hostile","soulscars":0,"languages":"Trade Common, Arcana, Daemonic","habitat":"Ruins, Shallows","reputation":15,"weakness":19,"weakPoint":"Slashing-type damage +3 points","initiative":15,"movementSpeed":"-/15(Floating)","fortitude":"10(17)","willpower":"10(17)","source":"AB, p. 123","description":"This Daemon appears as a floating skull. The head alone is about 1 meter in length, with 7 horns of varying sizes growing from the crown. Ethereal energy overflows from its eye sockets, open mouth, and cheeks, and merely approaching it causes one's vitality to drain. Rather than being a guardian of the Shallow Abyss, it seems to prioritize gathering intelligence through reconnaissance and surveillance of those who enter.\n\nWhen in danger, it channels mana into its horns to discharge, disappearing with a flash. While this removes the immediate threat, it has been observed that information about the PCs it was confronting gets transmitted to other Daemons, leading to situations where newly encountered Daemons already have accurate knowledge of the PCs' combat capabilities.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"◯Poison, Disease, Psychic Immunity","description":""},{"title":"◯Lightning Immunity","description":""},{"title":"►Miasma Breath / 9 (16) / Fortitude / Half","description":"Attacks by breathing miasma from its mouth. With \"Range/Area: 1 (10m) / Shot ,\" deals 2d+8 points of Poison magic damage to \"Target: 1 Character.\"\nTargets that fail their resistance check suffer a -2 penalty to Willpower and Death Checks for 3 minutes (18 rounds). This effect is treated as Poison type and can stack up to 4 times (total -8).\nThis ability cannot be used in consecutive turns."},{"title":"►Discharge Explosion / 10 (17) / Willpower / Half","description":"Discharges the horn on top of its head, causing it to explode and disappear. Within \"Range: Caster,\" deals \"2d+(half of remaining HP)\" points of Lightning magic damage to \"Target: 1 area (5m radius) / 15.\"\nThis ability cannot be used unless the monster's HP is \"20\" or below, and when conditions are met, it will be used as a priority. After using this ability, this monster's HP becomes \"0\" and it disappears."},{"title":"◯Discharge Transmission","description":"When self-destructing, information about all hostile characters is transmitted to other monsters located in distant areas.\nWhen HP falls to 0 or less while using the unique skill [►Discharge Explosion], all other monsters present in the Shallow Abyss where the user existed will have their \"Initiative\" and \"Weakness\" increased by +1 point.\nThis effect is permanent and can stack up to +4, but will disappear if that Shallow's Abyss Core is destroyed.\nThis ability can only be manifested in a Shallow Abyss or similar environment.\n2d |\nLoot |\nAlways |\nCrystallized Daemon's Blood (800G/Red A) |\n2 - 6 |\nChargeless Horn (220G/Red A) |\n7 - 11 |\nCharged Horn (730G/Red A) |\n12+ |\nLightning Horn (2,230G/Red S) |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Sevaseva","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":300000}
{"_id":"MwKqbaOuXNXbF5O4","name":"Godbell","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:godbell","level":9,"monsterType":"Daemon","intelligence":"Average","perception":"Five senses (Darkvision)","disposition":"Hostile","soulscars":0,"languages":"Daemonic","habitat":"Labyrinths, Ruins","reputation":16,"weakness":19,"weakPoint":"Physical damage +2 points","initiative":16,"movementSpeed":"15","fortitude":"12 (19)","willpower":"12 (19)","source":"CR III p. 418","description":"Godbells are subservient daemons, also known as \"formless daemons.\" They are completely invisible, even after death, so their true appearance is unknown. Their unique skills, however, allow Godbells to be extraordinary assassins.\n\nIt is feared as a Daemon that is difficult to counter since it can permeate space and can slip through walls to surprise its enemies.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"◯ Complete Invisibility","description":"Godbell is always invisible. See rules for invisibility (CR II, p. 69)."},{"title":"◯ Invisible Assassin/20/Danger Sense/Negates","description":"If a character approaches a location where this monster is lurking, they need to make a Danger Sense check with target number 20. If they fail, they will be taken by surprise by this monster."},{"title":"► Twin Strike &amp; Double Attack","description":"A Godbell can make two Claws attacks each round. They may choose to attack different characters with each attack."},{"title":"► Space Warp","description":"The monster can move 2 meters through the space itself without being affected by any obstacles or magic effects. There must be no other objects or characters at the destination.\nNote that this ability has a very limited effect in combat (it is meaningless in Simplified Combat, and even in Standard Combat, the distance is insufficient to get past the skirmish).\n2d |\nLoot |\nAlways |\nCrystallized Daemon's Blood (800G/Red A) |\n2 - 10 |\nNothing |\n11+ |\nTransparent Leather (1,400G/Red S) |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Godbell","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":100000}
{"_id":"NRtudAoteZgTcISw","name":"Nazrak","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:nazrak","level":5,"monsterType":"Daemon","intelligence":"Average","perception":"Five senses (Darkvision)","disposition":"Hostile","soulscars":0,"languages":"Daemonic","habitat":"Shallow Abysses","reputation":13,"weakness":16,"weakPoint":"Magic Damage +2 points","initiative":12,"movementSpeed":"5/-","fortitude":"7 (14)","willpower":"7 (14)","source":"CR I p. 430","description":"This 5-meter-long daemon is found mainly in and around Shallow Abysses. It is octopus-shaped with only two tentacles, its body is the head, and it has only one huge eye without eyelids.\n\nA daemon tends to remain where it is thought to have been summoned or come through and does not significantly shift where it is active.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"► Intimidating Gaze/6 (13)/Willpower/Negates","description":"Nazrak stares at \"Target: 1 Character\" within \"Range/Area: 2 (20m)/ Target \" and terrifies it. The target takes a -2 penalty on all action checks for 10 seconds (1 round).\nThis effect is Psychic type."},{"title":"► Frenzied Gaze/6 (13)/Willpower/Negates","description":"Nazrak stares at \"Target: 1 Character\" within \"Range/Area: 2 (20m)/ Target \" and drives it temporarily insane. The target receives a +2 bonus to any action check for 3 minutes (18 rounds), but it loses 5 points of HP at the end of its turn. This may result in a zero or negative HP. If the target becomes unconscious, the effect is automatically removed.\nThis effect is Psychic type.\nTentacle"},{"title":"🗨 Tail Sweep","description":"It can attack up to 3 characters that can be reached with Tentacle attacks. The Accuracy check should be rolled once, and if multiple characters are hit, the damage is determined individually.\nThis ability cannot be used on consecutive turns."},{"title":"◯ Attack Obstacle = +4 • None","description":"Nazrak's height prevents enemies from attacking it. The Head receives a +4 bonus to Evasion checks against melee attacks.\nIf any of the Tentacle sections have 0 HP or less, this effect is lost.\n2d |\nLoot |\nAlways |\nDaemon's Blood (100G/Red A) |\n2 - 8 |\nNothing |\n9+ |\nAbyss Shard (200G) |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Nazrak","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":500000}
{"_id":"NSE3OwyRtpVop1TE","name":"Ergacleo","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:ergacleo","level":11,"monsterType":"Daemon","intelligence":"High","perception":"Five Senses (Darkvision)","disposition":"Neutral","soulscars":0,"languages":"Daemonic, Arcana","habitat":"Ruins","reputation":17,"weakness":20,"weakPoint":"Physical Damage +2","initiative":16,"movementSpeed":"15/-","fortitude":"13 (20)","willpower":"15 (22)","source":"BM","description":"Ergacleo is a forward-leaning Daemon with numerous tentacles sprouting from its head. When fully extended, Ergacleo can reach a height of 4 meters, but it usually bends its body to a height of fewer than 2 meters. This daemon is a fearsome magician who has created many spells, and conversely, has a unique skill that renders its body impervious to any magic. Its long, slender limbs and torso are weak, and it tries to protect them from enemy attacks as much as possible.\n\nPerhaps because of their high intelligence, they are sometimes sealed in ancient archives and other places as guardians or librarians, or used as servants. Naturally, however, it is not their intention to live there forever, and they will try to break free by lies. If this is impossible, they will kill the intruder (even if the seal is released, they will still try to kill them). They seem to take pleasure in accumulating magical knowledge and may possess several rare grimoires.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"► Truespeech Magic , Spiritualism Magic , Divine Magic 10 Level/Magic Power 14 (21)","description":""},{"title":"◯ 🗨 Magical Aptitude","description":"They can use the Combat Feats [ Targeting ], [ Magic Convergence ], [ Magic Control ], [ Hawk Eye ], [ Universal Metamagic ], and [ Mana Save ]."},{"title":"◯ Magic Immunity","description":"This monster is immune to magic. An Ergacleo's HP cannot be reduced by magic damage.\nItems, unique skills of the monsters, and other non-magic effects obtained by other-type classes are effective, but they do not cause magic damage."},{"title":"◯ Anesthetic Poison/Can't","description":"A target hit by a Tentacle attack will be unable to perform any movement action for 30 seconds (3 rounds). Also, during this period, the target gains a -2 penalty for any Action Checks.\nThis effect is a poison type. If the method of removing poison is used, it succeeds automatically without the need to compare the Success Value.\n2d |\nLoot |\nAlways |\nCrystallized Daemon's Blood (800G/Red A) |\n2 - 12 |\nOrdinary Grimoire (500G/White A) |\n13+ |\nRare Grimoire (3,000G/White S) x 2 |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Ergacleo","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":200000}
{"_id":"NoldVhToth4pvaCm","name":"Holgrad","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:holgrad","level":12,"monsterType":"Daemon","intelligence":"High","perception":"Five senses (Darkvision)","disposition":"Hostile","soulscars":0,"languages":"Arcane, Daemonic","habitat":"Ruins, Shallow Abysses","reputation":18,"weakness":22,"weakPoint":"Accuracy +1","initiative":18,"movementSpeed":"10/10(Flying)","fortitude":"15 (22)","willpower":"15 (22)","source":"Monstrous Lore p. 210","description":"Holgrad is a Daemon whose entire body is composed of black mist (see ML p. 5). It looks like a silhouette of a woman wearing a shimmering cloak or a deformed figure with numerous tentacles fluttering in the air.\n\nIt is familiar with many systems of magic and has a strong attachment to them. It is furious when magic is used in front of it and takes the initiative in eliminating and weakening enemy magicians.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"◯ Normal Weapon Immunity","description":""},{"title":"► Truespeech Magic , Spiritualism Magic , Summoning Arts 12 Level /Magic Power 15 (22)","description":""},{"title":"◯ 🗨 Magic Aptitude","description":"They can use the Combat Feats [ Targeting ], [ Hawk Eye ], [ Magic Convergence ], [ Magic Control ], [ Universal Metamagic ], and [ Multi-Action ]."},{"title":"► Mana-binding Fog/15 (22)/Willpower/Temporary","description":"Within \"Range/Area: 2 (30m)/ Target \" this fog will cause black mana to cling to the \"Target: 1 Character\" and inhibit the casting spell.\nThe target has all Magic Power reduced by -5 for 3 minutes (18 rounds).\nThis effect cannot be used in consecutive turns and costs 10 MP."},{"title":"🗨 Mana Strike = +15 damage","description":"May deal an additional +15 damage to their next melee attack. At risk, they take a -2 penalty to their Fortitude and Willpower checks.\n2d |\nLoot |\n2 - 8 |\nNothing |\n9 - 11 |\nOld Grimoire (4,000G/Green White S) |\n12+ |\nAncient Grimoire (9,000G/Green White S) |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Holgrad","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"NwQkxLFFk5kMWZX7","name":"Vangiga","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:vangiga","level":14,"monsterType":"Daemon","intelligence":"High","perception":"Five senses (Darkvision)","disposition":"Hostile","soulscars":0,"languages":"Trade Common, Daemonic","habitat":"Ruins, Shallow Abysses","reputation":18,"weakness":22,"weakPoint":"Slashing damage +3 points","initiative":20,"movementSpeed":"15","fortitude":"16 (23)","willpower":"16 (23)","source":"CR III p. 422","description":"This is a high-rank Daemon with a monkey-like appearance, but instead of the usual shoulders and arms, it has six long arms sprouting from its back. On the palm of each arm, there are facial parts such as eyes and ears (the original face also has normal features).\n\nAs additional sensory organs, these hands give them high perception and make them adept at avoiding danger.\n\nIt is said that this Daemon is the type who plans each action. When this Daemon appears in Shallow Abyss, it is said to be filled with countless traps and tricks.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"► Spiritualism Magic 12 Level /Magic Power 16 (23)","description":""},{"title":"◯ 🗨 ► Magic Aptitude","description":"They can use the Combat Feats [ Multi-Action ], [ Targeting ], [ Magic Convergence ], [ Magic Control ], [ Hawk Eye ], [ Universal Metamagic ], [ Rune Master ], and [ Wordbreak ].\nAll Hands"},{"title":"◯ Long Arms","description":"Hands can do melee attacks with \"Range/Area: 1 (10m) / Target \".\nEye Hands"},{"title":"◯ Sight Augmentation","description":"The Body section gains a +2 bonus to Evasion checks for each healthy Eye Hand section.\nEar Hands"},{"title":"◯ Hearing Augmentation","description":"This monster gains a +2 bonus to Fortitude and Willpower checks for each healthy Ear Hand section.\nNose Hands"},{"title":"◯ Memorize the Smell","description":"If Nose Hand performs an Accuracy check, regardless of the success or failure of the check, Body and Nose Hand sections gain a +2 bonus to Accuracy checks against the target. This effect is not cumulative and is removed when the Nose Hand section HP becomes 0 or less.\nMouth Hand"},{"title":"◯ Bloodsucking","description":"When a Bite attack hits, the HP of any one section of this monster is recovered by the same value as applied damage. The monster can choose which section to heal after each attack, and applied damage is calculated. However, the section whose HP is 0 or less cannot be selected for heal.\n2d |\nLoot |\nAlways |\nCrystallized Great Daemon's Blood (1,600G/Red S) |\n2 - 6 |\nTwitching Arm (200G/Red A) |\n7 - 9 |\nCreepy Arm (700G/Red A) |\n10+ |\nOminous Arm (2,500G/Red S) |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Vangiga","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"OQk0ePcUNXksONni","name":"Jinune","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:jinune","level":7,"monsterType":"Daemon","intelligence":"Average","perception":"Five senses (Darkvision)","disposition":"Hostile","soulscars":0,"languages":"Trade Common, Barbaric, Daemonic","habitat":"Forest, Shallow Abysses","reputation":14,"weakness":17,"weakPoint":"Bludgeoning damage +3","initiative":15,"movementSpeed":"30 (4 Legs)","fortitude":"10 (17)","willpower":"9 (16)","source":"DL","description":"This Daemon resembles a black horse that is about 5 meters in length. It has red eyes and a 1-meter-long black horn on its forehead.\n\nIt is brutal and ruthless and prefers to lure and trick lone Humanoids with its words.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"⏩ Red Eye Menace/9 (16)/Willpower/Negates","description":"Stares at \"Target: 1 Character\" within \"Range/Area: 1 (10m) / Target \", filling them with fear. A target who fails the resistance check suffers a -2 penalty on Accuracy and Evasion checks for 10 seconds (1 round).\nThis effect can be used only once per round. It also consumes 5 MP when used."},{"title":"◯ Vital Strike","description":"If the 2d roll determining damage is 9 or more, the damage is increased by +6 points.\n2d |\nLoot |\nAlways |\nDaemon's Blood (100G/Red A) |\n2 - 7 |\nTwisted Black Horn (380G/Red A) |\n8+ |\nTwisted Jet-Black Horn (1,480/Red S) |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Jinune","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":400000}
{"_id":"P8nnPuMD4zmk2gSW","name":"Jahgrad","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:jahgrad","level":12,"monsterType":"Daemon","intelligence":"Average","perception":"Five Senses (Darkvision)","disposition":"Hostile","soulscars":0,"languages":"Daemonic","habitat":"Rivers, Sea","reputation":19,"weakness":22,"weakPoint":"Earth Damage +3","initiative":21,"movementSpeed":"15/30 (Swimming)","fortitude":"15 (22)","willpower":"15 (22)","source":"BM","description":"Jahgrad is a strange-looking Daemon with a shark-like upper body and a human-like lower body with two legs.\n\nAlthough they are over 5 meters tall, they rarely seen in full size, as they are mainly live in the water. In the water, they move with amazing speed as they hunt down their prey.\n\nDespite their strange appearance, they are cunning and brutal, never letting their prey escape. Its back and chest fins are flexible and become sharp blades that slice through the enemy.\n\nThey may lurk in the vicinity of underwater ruins and will attack approaching creatures. They can also walk on land if necessary but rarely leave the water.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"◯ Underwater Aptitude","description":"Body"},{"title":"► Divine Magic 9 Level/Magic Power 11 (18)","description":""},{"title":"◯ 🗨 ► Magical Aptitude","description":"Jahgrad can use the combat feats [ Multi-Action ], [ Targeting ], [ Universal Metamagic ] and [ Wordbreak ]."},{"title":"🗨 All-out Attack","description":"A Bite attack can deal an additional 8 damage on its next attack. However, any Evasion check made by this section this turn receives a -3 penalty."},{"title":"◯ Catch and Hold","description":"If a Bite attack hits, the target is caught and held in the Jahgrad's jaws. The target cannot move, and will be automatically hit by further Bite attacks from the next round onwards.\nWhen the target attempts to escape, it follows the de-bonding rules (see ML, p. 71). The Jahgrad can automatically release the target it holds in its mouth with a Minor Action.\nWhile Catch and Hold is in use, the Body Section cannot attack other characters or use magic. Likewise, the Fin sections cannot attack the character being held by Catch and Hold in the Jahgrad's mouth.\nDorsal Fin"},{"title":"◯ Continuous Attack II","description":"If the Dorsal Fin successfully hits a target in Melee, it may make a second attack against the same target. If the second attack also hits, it may then make a third attack.\nPectoral Fin"},{"title":"► Pull / 16 (23) / Evasion / Negates","description":"Extends its fins and wraps them around \"Target: 1 Character\" with \"Range/Area: 2 (20m) / Shot \". This deals 2d+12 physical damage to the target and moves it into the same area or coordinates as the Jahgrad.\n2d |\nLoot |\nAlways |\nCrystalized Daemon's Blood |\nAlways |\nJagged Tooth (30G/Red B) x 2 |\n2 - 6 |\nFresh Fins (1000G/Red S) |\n7+ |\nFresh Fins (1000G/Red S) x 2 |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Jahgrad","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"Pg41264NrILFhDkV","name":"Tikira","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:tikira","level":9,"monsterType":"Daemon","intelligence":"Average","perception":"Five Senses (Darkvision)","disposition":"Hostile","soulscars":0,"languages":"Daemonic","habitat":"Underground Labyrinth, Ruins","reputation":15,"weakness":20,"weakPoint":"Physical Damage +2","initiative":13,"movementSpeed":"-/40 (Flying)","fortitude":"12 (19)","willpower":"13 (20)","source":"BM","description":"20cm high, the Tikira is a small daemon that looks similar to a Human but has the compound eyes and membranous wings of a dragonfly. They love to fly around and cause mischief, taking pleasure in someone else's misfortunes.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"► Divine Magic 9 Level/Magic Power 13 (20)","description":""},{"title":"► Paradox","description":"The Tikira can cause spells that would recover HP to deal Magic damage instead by spending twice as much MP to cast those spells."},{"title":"🗨 ► Magic Aptitude","description":"They can use the Combat Feats [ Multi-Action ], [ Universal Metamagic ], and [ Wordbreak ]."},{"title":"◯ Flight","description":"Receives a +1 bonus to Accuracy and Evasion only for melee attacks."},{"title":"◯ Mockery","description":"The Tikira find failure hilarious and will begin uncontrollably laughing when anyone, friend, or foe, Automatically Fails on a roll. While laughing, the Tikira cannot use magic until the end of their next turn."},{"title":"◯ Unluck","description":"The first time any character would roll double 6s (other than the Tikira), that roll gets changed to double 1's instead (which triggers the Tikira's [ ◯ Mockery] unique skill). It is possible to change the roll back to double 6's using [Sword's Grace/Change Fate], however, this unique skill would then affect the next roll of double 6's that occurs. If there are multiple Tikira's on the battlefield, each one of them can use this unique skill for different double 6s.\n2d |\nLoot |\nAlways |\nCrystallized Daemon's Blood (800G/Red A) |\n2 - 6 |\nNothing |\n7 - 12 |\nDaemon Wings (350G/Red A) |\n13+ |\nRainbow Daemon Wings (1,500G/Gold Red S) |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Tikira","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":500000}
{"_id":"Q4twBgie2nu0SVO4","name":"Gezed","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:gezed","level":6,"monsterType":"Daemon","intelligence":"Average","perception":"Five senses (Darkvision)","disposition":"Hostile","soulscars":0,"languages":"Trade Common, Barbaric, Daemonic","habitat":"Forests, Shallows","reputation":13,"weakness":17,"weakPoint":"Accuracy +1","initiative":13,"movementSpeed":"10 (4 Legs)","fortitude":"9(16)","willpower":"8(15)","source":"AB, p. 122","description":"This is a Daemon that takes the form of a child mounted on large animals like giant bears, boars, and elephants. While the child appears to be merely riding, they are actually connected, and the large creature is also part of the Daemon. Physically, the child portion functions similar to other creatures' faces, controlling various sensory organs.\n\nWhile the child appears very charming and triggers protective instincts, this is merely an illusion that the monster creates to deceive those around it. It can mimic the cries of various Humanoid and Barbarous races, and it enjoys luring victims closer with these voices before brutally slaughtering those who approach carelessly.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"► Truespeech Magic 6 Level / Magic Power 8 (15)","description":""},{"title":"◯🗨Magic Aptitude","description":"They can use Combat Feats [ Multi-Action ], [ Targeting ], and [ Metamagic/Targets ]."},{"title":"◯Adorable Form / 7 (14) / Willpower / Negates","description":"The adorable form of a child appears to be targets own child or someone close to them.\nAll Humanoids and Barbarous characters within \"All Areas (30m radius)/Space\" centered on this monster must make a Willpower check at the start of their turn against this ability.\nOn failure, for 10 seconds (1 round), they become unable to take any actions that could potentially harm Child section. The GM determines what actions could potentially cause harm.\nThis effect is Psychic type. Additionally, once a character succeeds at resistance, they automatically succeed at resistance thereafter."},{"title":"⏩Beloved Child's Cry / 7 (14) / Willpower / Negates","description":"Within \"Range: Caster\" with \"Target: 1 Area (5m radius) / All,\" it mimics the crying of a baby or young creature. Humanoids and Barbarous characters who fail their Willpower check become distracted by the crying and receive a -1 penalty to all action checks for 10 seconds (1 round). This effect is Psychic type and can only be used once per turn.\nFront/Rear"},{"title":"◯Attack Obstacle = +4 • None","description":"Size hinders attacks.\nThe Child section gains a +4 bonus to Evasion checks against melee attacks.\nThis effect is lost when either the Front or Rear section's HP drops to 0 or below."},{"title":"◯Overdraft / 8 (15) / Adventurer Level + Strength Modifier / Negates","description":"Knocks prone opponents hit by Stomp.\nWhen Stomp hits, a check must be made against this ability. Failed targets fall prone.\n2d |\nLoot |\nAlways |\nDaemon's Blood (100G/Red A) |\n2 - 8 |\nNothing |\n9+ |\nAbyss Shard (200G/-) |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Gezed","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":400000}
{"_id":"R2XmSNsQQ7fs4vpk","name":"Imp","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:imp","level":2,"monsterType":"Daemon","intelligence":"Average","perception":"Five senses (Darkvision)","disposition":"Hostile","soulscars":0,"languages":"Youma, Daemonic","habitat":"Various","reputation":12,"weakness":15,"weakPoint":"Slashing damage +3","initiative":9,"movementSpeed":"10/10(Flying)","fortitude":"3 (10)","willpower":"4 (11)","source":"CR III p. 411","description":"Imps are small hairless daemons with brown skin, bat-like wings, and a tail pointed like a spear. Often used as messengers for the Daemons, Imps are typically sent to help others who may do the work of the Daemons. As such, seeing an Imp nearby may mean stronger Daemons are not far off.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"► Divine Magic 2 Level/Magic Power 4 (11)","description":""},{"title":"◯ Flight","description":"An Imp receives a +1 bonus to Accuracy and Evasion only for melee attacks."},{"title":"◯ Paralyzing Poison/3 (10)/Fortitude/Negates","description":"If the Imp hits with its Tail attack and inflicts 1 or more applied damage, the target receives a -2 penalty to Evasion checks for 30 seconds (3 rounds).\nThis effect is not cumulative and is of the poison type.\n2d |\nLoot |\nAlways |\nDaemon's Blood (100G/Red A) |\n2 - 8 |\nNothing |\n9+ |\nPoison Tail (150G/Red A) |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Imp","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"Uwax6k8Z6G2c71m2","name":"Nuzumal","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:nuzumal","level":3,"monsterType":"Daemon","intelligence":"Low","perception":"Five senses (Darkvision)","disposition":"Hostile","soulscars":0,"languages":"Daemonic","habitat":"Labyrinths, Ruins, Swamps","reputation":12,"weakness":14,"weakPoint":"Fire damage +3 points","initiative":10,"movementSpeed":"10 (4 Legs)/10(Swimming)","fortitude":"4 (11)","willpower":"5 (12)","source":"CR III p. 412","description":"Nuzumal is a small daemon, about 1.2 meters tall. Its green skin resembles that of amphibians, and its head is also reminiscent of a frog, with large protruding eyes and a wide, side-slit mouth.\n\nThe green blood they shed has cursed power that burns the skin of those it touches.\n\nIt is said that they like humidity, lives in swamps and other places, and attack in groups, dragging their poor victims with them.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"◯ Underwater Aptitude","description":""},{"title":"► Greenblood Curse/4 (11)/Willpower/Half","description":"Within \"Range: Touch,\" Nuzumal deals 2d+2 Curse magic damage to \"Target: 1 Character\". Using this ability consumes 4 points of its HP and MP each.\n2d |\nLoot |\nAlways |\nDaemon's Blood (100G/Red A) |\n2 - 6 |\nNothing |\n7+ |\nDaemon's Blood (100G/Red A) |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Nuzumal","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":500000}
{"_id":"Uy6Nqg4cwRzw3cvw","name":"Zang","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:zang","level":5,"monsterType":"Daemon","intelligence":"Low","perception":"Five Senses (Darkvision)","disposition":"Hostile","soulscars":0,"languages":"Daemonic","habitat":"Ruins, Shallows","reputation":11,"weakness":15,"weakPoint":"Magic Damage +2","initiative":12,"movementSpeed":"14/14 (Flying)","fortitude":"7 (14)","willpower":"7 (14)","source":"ES, Battle Mastery p. 148","description":"A Lesser Daemon that resembles a knight, clad in full-body armor that shines a deep black, with membranous wings on its back that allow it to fly.\n\nIn its right hand, it holds an axe-like weapon, and in its left what appears to be a medium-sized shield, but in reality, everything, including the armor that covers its entire body, is made of the Daemon's hardened skin.\n\nIn addition to serving as guardians of ruins, they sometimes seem to be acting as bodyguards to more powerful Daemons.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"◯ Flight","description":"Receives a +1 bonus to Accuracy and Evasion only for melee attacks."},{"title":"🗨 Raise Shield","description":"Gains +2 Defense and -3 damage from attacks for 10 seconds (1 round). This must be declared before performing a Major Action."},{"title":"🗨 Power Strike I","description":"They can deal an additional +4 damage on their next attack. However, any Evasion Check made by them this turn receives a -2 penalty.\n2d |\nLoot |\nAlways |\nDaemon's Blood (100G/Red A) |\n2 - 6 |\nNothing |\n7+ |\nPiece of Flesh (30G/Red Black B) x 1d |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Zang","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":600000}
{"_id":"V5JRgGT6Pqg32O0s","name":"Sallytegane","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:sallytegane","level":11,"monsterType":"Daemon","intelligence":"High","perception":"Five senses (Darkvision)","disposition":"Hostile","soulscars":0,"languages":"Trade Common, Daemonic","habitat":"Mountains","reputation":18,"weakness":21,"weakPoint":"Magic damage +2 points","initiative":18,"movementSpeed":"-/20(Flying)","fortitude":"14 (21)","willpower":"14 (21)","source":"CR III p. 420","description":"This is a white, lower Daemon, about 3m long, in the shape of a white bug, with four beautiful bird feathers. Its white body surface, including its wings, is not covered with feathers but rather hard rocks.\n\nIts body emits an intense odor that pierces the nose.\n\nIt is said that it is arrogant and always looks down on others, especially those who give it orders, and that it will always rebel.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"► Divine Magic 10 Level/Magic Power 13 (20)","description":""},{"title":"◯ 🗨 Magic Aptitude","description":"They can use the Combat Feats [ Multi-Action ], [ Targeting ], and [ Metamagic/Targets ]."},{"title":"⏩ Strange Smell/13 (20)/Fortitude/Negates","description":"All the body's holes within \"Range: Caster\" emit a foul odor. All characters in the same position (area, coordinate) as the Body section receive a -2 penalty to Willpower for 3 minutes (18 rounds).\nThis ability can be used only once per round, and when used, it consumes 5 MP of the Body section and can be used only once per round.\nThis effect is Disease type.\nWings"},{"title":"◯ Flight","description":"All sections receive a +1 bonus to Accuracy and Evasion only for melee attacks.\nIf the Wings section falls to 0 HP or lower, this unique skill cannot be used."},{"title":"🗨 All-Out Attack","description":"Wings can deal an additional 8 damage on its next attack. However, any Evasion check made by this section this turn receives a -3 penalty."},{"title":"⏩ High Mobility","description":"The skin covering the wings peels off, exposing the flesh and increasing mobility. For 3 minutes (18 rounds), the bonus to Accuracy checks and Evasion checks from [ ◯ Flight] for all sections is increased to +2.\nOn the other hand, the Defense of Wings section is reduced by -4.\nThis effect can be used only when the Wings section's HP is 40 or less, and once it is used, it cannot be canceled by the monster's will.\n2d |\nLoot |\nAlways |\nCrystallized Daemon's Blood (800G/Red A) |\n2 - 11 |\nCalcareous Fragments (300G/Black A) x 1d |\n12+ |\nLarge Calcareous Fragments (3,000G/Black S) |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Sallytegane","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":500000}
{"_id":"WUZrG5MhOT5PnscW","name":"Barraganbuk","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:barraganbuk","level":7,"monsterType":"Daemon","intelligence":"High","perception":"Magic","disposition":"Hostile","soulscars":0,"languages":"Trade Common, Regional dialect (Dorden), Arcana, Daemonic","habitat":"Unknown","reputation":14,"weakness":18,"weakPoint":"Accuracy +1","initiative":14,"movementSpeed":"14","fortitude":"9 (16)","willpower":"10 (17)","source":"Natural History of Dorden p. 132","description":"This is a Daemon which appears in urban areas of the Dorden Region, especially in wealthy households. Its usual appearance is strikingly similar to a Human, often taking the form of a beautiful steward or a handsome cook.\n\nThe Barraganbuk is a master of cooking and can read Humanoid desires, creating their most craved dishes using parts of its own body, plus ordinary ingredients. Once someone tastes its food, ordinary people become mesmerized to the point where they can't eat anything else. The Barraganbuk thus enslaves Humans to its cooking, fattening them up several times their original size until they can barely walk, at which point it uses them as ingredients and devours them itself.\n\nThe Barraganbuk emits a refined scent similar to grapes, which can sometimes be a clue to uncovering its true identity. Since it transforms its body including clothes, it cannot change its attire (though it can prepare and wear clothes in advance).\n\nIts true form resembles a giant pitcher plant, with two short legs and long, vine-like tentacles. It uses these tentacles to entangle its prey, throwing them into the large mouth on its body, where they are dissolved for nourishment.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"◯Normal Weapon Immunity","description":""},{"title":"◯Poison, Disease Immunity","description":""},{"title":"⏩△Mimicry (Incomplete)","description":"Mimics the form of a Humanoid. The details of this form differ for each individual, and there is no specific model (it cannot imitate someone's exact appearance). In Humanoid form, the abilities of the Body section cannot be used."},{"title":"◯Daemon's Cuisine / 9 (16) / Fortitude / Negates","description":"Prepares and serves dishes that stimulate desire using various ingredients. Characters who eat food prepared with this ability must make a resistance check. If failed, their Agility or Dexterity immediately decreases by 1 point, and they begin to treat this dish (and the monster who created it) as their most precious possession. They will spare no effort to eat this meal again, even refusing other food in order to obtain meals created by this ability.\nThe effect of ability score decay accumulates one point with each meal consumed. When the total decay of any ability score reaches 12, or if any ability score becomes 0 due to this effect, that character becomes unable to perform any actions or movements of their own will. This effect is treated as Curse + Psychic (see CR II, p. 128). Using this ability decreases the Barraganbuk's HP by 10 points.\nThis ability requires 1 hour to use. One use can prepare meals for approximately 10 Humanoids. It can only be used once per day."},{"title":"◯Delicate Loot","description":"If the HP of the Head section falls to 0 or less and the HP of the Body section is 1 or higher, the loot of \"Daemon's Seasoning\" will be lost.\nHead"},{"title":"🗨◯Magic Aptitude","description":"They can use the Combat Feats [ Targeting ], [ Metamagic/Targets ], and [ Multi-Action ]."},{"title":"◯ Spiritualism Magic 7 Level/Magic Power 9(16)","description":"Body"},{"title":"►Engulf and Dissolve / 9 (16) / Fortitude / Negates","description":"Engulfs an enemy within their body and dissolves them with internal corrosive fluids. One target character within \"Range: Touch\" takes 2d points of fixed damage and is engulfed. The engulfed target takes 2d points of fixed damage at the start of this monster's turn. Furthermore, the target becomes immobilized and cannot perform any Major Actions other than escaping from the body.\nEscape follows the rules for de-bonding (see ML, p. 71). This ability cannot target characters with multiple sections. Also, if a character is already engulfed by this ability, it cannot be used on other characters. Releasing an already engulfed character voluntarily is possible as a Minor Action.\nWhen this ability deals fixed damage to a target, the Head section's HP is restored by the same amount."},{"title":"►Twin Strike &amp; Double Attack","description":"The Body can make two Vine attacks each round. After checking the result of the first attack, the monster can choose whether to make a second attack on the same target further or on a different target of their choice.\n2d |\nLoot |\nAlways |\nDaemon's Seasoning (2000G) |\nAlways |\nCrystallized Daemon's Blood (800G/Red A) |\n2 - 9 |\nNothing |\n10+ |\nDaemon's Fiber (1,100G/Green S) |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Barraganbuk","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":200000}
{"_id":"WuBPjKzJu26AYryP","name":"Geldam","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:geldam","level":19,"monsterType":"Daemon","intelligence":"High","perception":"Five senses (Darkvision)","disposition":"Hostile","soulscars":0,"languages":"Trade Common, Daemonic","habitat":"Labyrinths, Ruins","reputation":22,"weakness":27,"weakPoint":"Bludgeoning damage +3 points","initiative":26,"movementSpeed":"20","fortitude":"26 (33)","willpower":"25 (32)","source":"CR III p. 426","description":"This goat-like daemon is one of the highest-ranking daemons, subservient to only the Daemon King. Geldams are large, muscular goatmen, 5m tall, and carry a massive glaive. These glaives are larger than adult humans, and magically bonded to the Geldam that carries them, so it is impossible to claim one as the spoils of battle.\n\nConsummate commanders of other daemons, Geldams have hundreds of lesser daemons at their command. Because of their service to the Daemon King in the Daemon Realm, they will rarely appear in Raxia themselves, preferring to send any number of lesser daemons in their stead.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"◯ Poison Immunity, ◯ Disease Immunity","description":""},{"title":"◯ Miasma Shroud/25 (32)/Fortitude/Half","description":"Strong poison gas swirls around Geldam. Each time a character attempts a melee attack against this monster, they suffer 2d+10 Poison magic damage, regardless of success or failure.\nThis poison gas deflects incoming arrows and bullets and has the same effect as the Fairy Magic spell [ Missile Protection ].\nHead"},{"title":"◯ 2 Actions","description":"Can perform two Major Actions in one round."},{"title":"► Divine Magic 15 Level/Magic Power 21 (28)","description":""},{"title":"◯ 🗨 ► Magic Aptitude","description":"They can use the Combat Feats [ Multi-Action ], [ Targeting ], [ Magic Convergence ], [ Magic Control ], [ Metamagic/Targets ], [ Rune Master ], and [ Wordbreak ]."},{"title":"► Poison Breath/24 (31)/Fortitude/Half","description":"With \"Range: Caster,\" it scatters smoky poison breath around it and deals to \"Target: 1 area (6m Radius)/20\" 2d+20 Poison magic damage.\nThis ability can only be used once every 10 seconds (1 round).\nUpper Body"},{"title":"◯ Multiple Declarations = 2 times","description":""},{"title":"► Sweeping Attack","description":"Geldam makes a Weapon attack against all enemies that it can reach. If [ 🗨 Power Strike III] is declared, the damage is added to any one of the hit characters. The effect of [ 🗨 Magic Weapon] becomes the success value of the Accuracy check for all targets.\nThis unique skill cannot be used on consecutive turns."},{"title":"🗨 Magic Weapon","description":"Changes the success value of the Accuracy check with the weapon to 35 without rolling any dice.\nThis ability cannot be used on consecutive turns."},{"title":"🗨 Power Strike III","description":"They can deal an additional +20 damage on their next attack. However, any Evasion Check made by them this turn receives a -2 penalty.\nLower Body"},{"title":"◯ Attack Obstacle = +4 • None","description":"Against melee attacks, the Upper Body and Head sections receive a +4 bonus to Evasion checks.\nThis effect disappears when Lower Body section falls to 0 HP or lower.\n2d |\nLoot |\nAlways |\nCrystallized Great Daemon's Blood (1,600G/Red S) |\nAlways |\nGreat Daemon's Glaive (3,200G/Gold Black White S) |\n2 - 9 |\nGreat Daemon's Earrings (6,900G/Gold White S) |\n10+ |\nGreat Daemon's Ring (14,000G/Gold White SS) |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Geldam","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"X3VbLUi36romoI0H","name":"Dikka","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:dikka","level":3,"monsterType":"Daemon","intelligence":"Animal","perception":"Magic","disposition":"Hostile","soulscars":0,"languages":"None","habitat":"Shallows","reputation":10,"weakness":14,"weakPoint":"Accuracy +1","initiative":10,"movementSpeed":"8 (6 Legs) / 15 (Flying)","fortitude":"4(11)","willpower":"4(11)","source":"AB, p. 121","description":"This is a lower-ranked Daemon in the form of a beetle, about 50cm in length with a purple shell. On its back, there are patterns visible through variations in color shading. Several twisted horns protrude from the top of its head, which it uses to attack by lunging forward to impale its targets.\n\nIt is often spotted in and around areas where Shallow Abysses occur. When flying, its wings produce intense sounds that resemble the groans of the dead, earning it names like the \"Groaning Beetle.\"","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"◯Psychic Immunity","description":""},{"title":"◯Flight","description":"Gains a +1 bonus to Accuracy checks and Evasion checks for melee attacks."},{"title":"◯Disturbing Wing Sound / 4 (11) / Willpower / Negates","description":"While flying, it produces wing sounds like the groans of the dead. All characters within 1 area (5m radius) must attempt a Willpower check at the start of their turn. On failure, they receive a -1 penalty to Accuracy checks and Spellcasting checks for 10 seconds (1 round).\n2d |\nLoot |\nAlways |\nDaemon's Blood (100G/Red A) |\n2 - 6 |\nNothing |\n7+ |\nThin Feathers (190G/Red A) |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Dikka","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":400000}
{"_id":"YZ6PxeL06UnX8Xlb","name":"Jarega","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:jarega","level":3,"monsterType":"Daemon","intelligence":"Low","perception":"Five Senses (Darkvision)","disposition":"Hostile","soulscars":0,"languages":"None","habitat":"Ruins, Forests, Mountains","reputation":9,"weakness":12,"weakPoint":"Water/Ice Damage +3","initiative":10,"movementSpeed":"-/10 (Flying)","fortitude":"6 (13)","willpower":"4 (11)","source":"ES, Battle Mastery p. 148","description":"It is a Lesser Daemon that resembles a 1m long snake with feathered wings. Primarily used as an aerial vanguard, it spits fire from its mouth and possesses powerful fangs. They often appear in groups and prefer cunning tactics, such as striking from above in mountainous areas.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"◯ Flight","description":"Receives a +1 bonus to Accuracy and Evasion only for melee attacks."},{"title":"► Fireball/5 (12)/Fortitude/Half","description":"Within \"Range/Area: 2 (20m) / Shot \" and \"Target: 1 Character,\" a fireball is spits out at the target, dealing 2d+3 Fire magic damage.\nThis ability cannot be used on consecutive turns.\n2d |\nLoot |\nAlways |\nDaemon's Blood (100G/Red A) |\n2 - 9 |\nNothing |\n10+ |\nSerpent Daemon's Feathers (90G / Red B) |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Jarega","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":300000}
{"_id":"cTNVji0LGZn8JqCw","name":"Xenu","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:xenu","level":6,"monsterType":"Daemon","intelligence":"High","perception":"Five senses (Darkvision)","disposition":"Hostile","soulscars":0,"languages":"Daemonic, Arcana","habitat":"Shallow Abysses","reputation":14,"weakness":18,"weakPoint":"Slashing type damage +3","initiative":14,"movementSpeed":"14/21(Flying)","fortitude":"9 (16)","willpower":"8 (15)","source":"VC","description":"This Daemon has the head of an anteater and the torso of a strong human male. Its whole body is reddish gray, and it is covered with feathers, which allow it to fly. It prefers to observe Humanoids and Barbarous who live a hedonistic and momentary life.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"► Truespeech Magic 6 Level/Magic Power 8 (15)","description":""},{"title":"◯ 🗨 Magic Aptitude","description":"They can use the Combat Feats [ Targeting ] and [ Metamagic/Targets ].\nBody"},{"title":"◯ Attack Obstacle = +4 • None","description":"Xenu's height hinders enemies from attacking it. Head receives a +4 bonus to Evasion checks against melee attacks.\nIf the Body section has 0 HP or less, this effect is lost.\n2d |\nLoot |\nAlways |\nDaemon's Blood (100G/Red A) |\n2 - 6 |\nNothing |\n7 - 10 |\nWagging Tongue (140G/Red A) |\n11+ |\nSlimy Tongue (750G/Red A) |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Xenu","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":300000}
{"_id":"cpiSL4GjRvGSZMcw","name":"Dreadbar","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:dreadbar","level":15,"monsterType":"Daemon","intelligence":"High","perception":"Five senses (Darkvision)","disposition":"Hostile","soulscars":0,"languages":"Daemonic","habitat":"Rivers, Seas, Ruins","reputation":21,"weakness":23,"weakPoint":"Fire damage + 3 points","initiative":21,"movementSpeed":"20 (4 Legs)/20(Swimming)","fortitude":"19 (26)","willpower":"18 (25)","source":"Monstrous Lore p. 213","description":"Dreadbar is a bizarre daemon with a giant crocodile's lower body and a human's upper body. It has crocodile skin and large horns and uses spears and other weapons. It is 5m tall and 10m in length.\n\nDreadbar prefers to be near water, such as oceans and rivers and sometimes makes underwater ruins it's home. It is very powerful and can use high-level Divine Magic. It sometimes has other Daemons, such as Melbiz , as its subordinates. Gilmen sometimes worship it as a god.\n\nAt first glance, the Human-like section appears to be its main section, but Dreadbar's brain is housed inside its crocodile-like front. When it speaks, its voice emits from the mouth of its upper body, which resembles a human, so that an uninformed opponent will not realize where its main section is.\n\nAlthough they have high intellect, they are brutal and enjoy killing, so if you encounter them, you will not be able to avoid a fight. They are sometimes found sealed as guardians in the underwater ruins of the Ancient Magical Civilization.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"◯ Underwater Aptitude","description":""},{"title":"◯ Regeneration = 10 points","description":"At the end of each round, each section of the Dreadbar recovers 10 HP. This has no effect if the section has 0 HP or lower.\nUpper Body"},{"title":"► Divine Magic 13 Level / Magic Power 17 (24)","description":""},{"title":"◯ 🗨 ► Magic Aptitude","description":"They can use the Combat Feats [ Multi-Action ], [ Targeting ], [ Magic Convergence ], [ Magic Control ], [ Universal Metamagic ], [ Wordbreak ]."},{"title":"🗨 Mana Strike = +17 damage","description":"May deal an additional +17 damage to their next melee attack. At risk, they take a -2 penalty to their Fortitude and Willpower checks.\nFront"},{"title":"► Twin Strike &amp; Double Attack","description":"A Dreadbar can make two Bite attacks each round. It may choose to attack different characters with each attack."},{"title":"► Blizzard Breath/16 (23)/Fortitude/Half","description":"The Dreadbar vomits a mass of cold air with \"Range/Area: 2 (30m)/ Shot \" in \"Target: 1 area (Radius 6m)/20\", dealing 2d+15 Water/Ice magic damage.\nThis unique skill cannot be used on consecutive turns.\nRear"},{"title":"🗨 Tail Swing","description":"A Dreadbar can use its Tail to attack up to 5 targets in the same skirmish.\n2d |\nLoot |\nAlways |\nCrystallized Great Daemon's Blood (1,600G/Red S) |\nAlways |\nWell-Balanced Spear (600G/Black White A) |\n2 - 8 |\nDaemon's Scales (600G/Red A) x 1d |\n9+ |\nGreen Scales (1,600G/Gold Red S) x 1d |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Dreadbar","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"dJlixAOW3mVsk7BJ","name":"Rigularador","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:rigularador","level":5,"monsterType":"Daemon","intelligence":"Average","perception":"Magic","disposition":"Hostile","soulscars":0,"languages":"Arcana, Daemonic","habitat":"Ruins, Shallows","reputation":13,"weakness":16,"weakPoint":"Magic damage +2 points","initiative":12,"movementSpeed":"-/15 (Flying)","fortitude":"7(14)","willpower":"6(13)","source":"AB, p. 122","description":"Rigularador is a Daemon that resembles a swan made of plants. Its entire body is translucent like a mesh, and bright green fire erupts from various parts of its internal body.\n\nIts appearance is beautiful and ethereal, and when it encounters Humanoids or Barbarous for the first time, it speaks to them in a friendly manner using Arcana, causing some to mistake it for an apparition or supernatural being. It cleverly lures them into the depths of ruins and remains, desiring their flesh and blood as parts, or entices them into the Shallow Abyss.\n\nIt has a sharp beak and talons, which it uses to slash at those who approach. It never uses its feet except for attacking, and always moves by flying.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"◯Fire Immunity","description":""},{"title":"◯Mesh-like Body","description":"The entire body has gaps like a woven basket, allowing the internal fire to be visible. It does not receive critical hits from edged weapons."},{"title":"◯Wavering Form in the Shallow","description":"Within a Shallow Abyss, the flickering fire grows larger, blurring this monster's outline. When making Accuracy checks or Spellcasting checks against this monster from a location away from adjacent areas (Simplified Combat), or from a distance of more than 10m (Standard Combat, Advanced Combat), you receive a -1 penalty.\nHead"},{"title":"◯Continuous Attack","description":"If a Head successfully hits a target in melee with Beak, they may make a second attack against the same target.\nBody"},{"title":"◯Flight","description":"All sections gain a +1 bonus to Accuracy and Evasion checks for melee attacks. This ability is lost if the Body section's HP falls below 0."},{"title":"►Rising Green Fire / 6 (13) / Fortitude / Half","description":"Green fire erupts from the entire body, attacking the surroundings.\nWithin \"Range: Caster\" and \"Target: 1 Area (3m radius) / 5\", this ability deals 2d+3 points of Fire magic damage. Furthermore, if the Fortitude Success Value against this ability results in 4 or more points lower than this ability's success value (or 9 or below in case of fixed values), the target becomes unable to visually perceive any sections of this monster for 10 seconds (1 round) due to being mesmerized by the flickering flames.\nThe inability to perceive is treated as Psychic type.\nWithin a Shallow Abyss, this ability gains a +1 bonus to its Success Value.\nThis ability cannot be used in consecutive turns.\n2d |\nLoot |\nAlways |\nDaemon's Blood (100G/Red A) |\n2 - 7 |\nNothing |\n8 - 11 |\nBurning Green Fire (130G/Gold A) |\n12+ |\nLighting Green Fire (630/Gold A) |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Rigularador","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":400000}
{"_id":"fHGIl658fYDnql09","name":"Mahatiga","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:mahatiga","level":10,"monsterType":"Daemon","intelligence":"Average","perception":"Five senses (Darkvision)","disposition":"Hostile","soulscars":0,"languages":"Daemonic","habitat":"Shallow Abysses","reputation":18,"weakness":22,"weakPoint":"Slashing damage +3","initiative":18,"movementSpeed":"25/25 (Flying)","fortitude":"13 (20)","willpower":"13 (20)","source":"CR II p. 407","description":"This is a daemon with the head of an elephant and the body of a raptor, frequently seen in Shallow Abysses.\n\nThey prioritize offering sacrifices to the god they believe in, and the more brutal the sacrifice, the better. They believe that the act of fighting is itself an offering to the gods.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"► Divine Magic 10 Level/Magic Power 12 (19)","description":""},{"title":"◯ 🗨 Magic Aptitude","description":"They can use the Combat Feats [ Targeting ], [ Metamagic/Targets ], and [ Multi-Action ]."},{"title":"🗨 Mana Strike = +12 damage","description":"May deal an additional +12 damage to their next melee attack. At risk, they take a -2 penalty to their Fortitude and Willpower checks.\nBody"},{"title":"► Twin Strike &amp; Double Attack","description":"It can make two Claws attacks each round, though each attack requires its own Accuracy check. They may choose to attack different characters with each attack.\nWings"},{"title":"◯ Flight","description":"All section receives a +1 bonus to Accuracy and Evasion only for melee attacks.\nIf the Wings section falls to 0 HP or lower, this unique skill cannot be used."},{"title":"► Wind-Edge Blade/12 (19)/Fortitude/Half","description":"With \"Range/Area: 2 (30m) / Target \", Mahatiga uses a blade made of feathers to deal with dealing 2d+12 slashing magic damage.\nThis ability costs 6 MP.\n2d |\nLoot |\nAlways |\nCrystallized Daemon's Blood (800G/Red A) |\n2 - 6 |\nDaemon's Nose (500G/Red A) |\n7 - 11 |\nLong Daemon's Nose (1,600G/Red S) |\n12+ |\nLustrous Daemon's Nose (4,000G/Red S) |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Mahatiga","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"fwb0p3Q3ewNCGG16","name":"Gannibaso","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:gannibaso","level":7,"monsterType":"Daemon","intelligence":"Average","perception":"Five senses (Darkvision)","disposition":"Hostile","soulscars":0,"languages":"Daemonic","habitat":"Shallows","reputation":15,"weakness":18,"weakPoint":"Physical damage +2 points","initiative":14,"movementSpeed":"20 (4 Legs)","fortitude":"9 (16)","willpower":"10 (17)","source":"AB, p. 123","description":"Gannibaso is a Lesser Daemon with the ability to fake an Abyss Core and hide itself. It resembles a large lizard or salamander. Its body surface is brown and constantly slimy, with thick, short limbs that it uses to crawl around. It exhausts adventurers who wander in search of Abyss Core to escape the Shallow Abyss by misleading and confusing them with fake Abyss Core created using its abilities.\n\nIts combat abilities are not high, and due to its cautious and timid nature, it rarely initiates attacks. When forced into combat, it transforms its body into mud and attempts to fight in environments where it has the advantage.\n\nWhile capable of conversation, it only speaks to beg for its life or to deceive others with sophistry, making meaningful communication or information gathering nearly impossible.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"◯Poison, Disease, Psychic Immunity","description":""},{"title":"◯Attitude Control","description":"It cannot be knocked prone by any effects."},{"title":"◯Mud Adaptation","description":"Does not receive penalties from difficult terrain."},{"title":"◯Daemon's Mimicry / 15 / Danger Sense / Negates","description":"Can use Mimicry to hide in mud puddles, water puddles, and dirt clumps. While using Mimicry, Monster Knowledge checks cannot be performed against this monster.\nIf a Danger Sense check fails, nothing happens but this monster moves to a different location. If successful, attacks and restraining attempts become possible.\nDoes not react to [ Sense Magic ] spells, but responds to spells like [ Search Daemon ]."},{"title":"◯Abyss Core Duplication","description":"Gannibaso can create a duplicate of the Abyss Core, swallow it, and move it around. While the duplicated Abyss Core is indistinguishable from the original, it cannot replicate its function (like being able to escape the Shallow Abyss by destroying it). Nothing happens if an Abyss Core duplicated by this ability is destroyed.\nIt takes 1 hour to create a duplicate using this ability. Furthermore, each Gannibaso cannot duplicate more than one at a time.\nWhen this duplicate is destroyed, the existence of this monster can be determined through a Monster Knowledge check, due to the inability to escape from the Shallow Abyss.\nWhen using Abyssal Magic [ Observe the Abyss ] while a duplicated Abyss Core exists, the location of the nearest Abyss Core will be revealed (this one or the real one)."},{"title":"⏩Mud Transformation / Can't","description":"Transform parts of its body into mud-like substance to blend in.\nApplies a -2 penalty to Evasion check and Willpower check within \"Range: Caster\" and \"Target: 1 area (5m radius)/All.\" This effect lasts for 10 seconds (1 round) and does not stack. Characters who are not touching the ground are not affected by the Evasion check penalty.\nWhen using Mud Transformation, Gannibaso cannot move. Additionally, it cannot receive critical hits from melee and ranged attacks.\n2d |\nLoot |\nAlways |\nCrystallized Daemon's Blood (800G/Red A) |\n2 - 9 |\nNothing |\n10+ |\nAbyss Shard (200G/-) x 1d |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Gannibaso","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":600000}
{"_id":"h65s6xpNsQn3F9SF","name":"Ragnakang","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:ragnakang","level":9,"monsterType":"Daemon","intelligence":"Average","perception":"Five senses (Darkvision)","disposition":"Hostile","soulscars":0,"languages":"Daemonic","habitat":"Labyrinths, Ruins","reputation":16,"weakness":19,"weakPoint":"Slashing damage +3","initiative":16,"movementSpeed":"15/20 (Flying)","fortitude":"12 (19)","willpower":"11 (18)","source":"CR II p. 406","description":"This is a daemon that appears as an upright dragon with enormous membranous wings. When a Ragnakang fully extends its neck, it stands around 5m long and will use that long neck and tail in combat. Thoroughly infused with poison, a Ragnakang is dangerous to touch, let alone engage in combat. Some still stand guard at the entrances to old ruins, and such places have seen no intrusions because of the Ragnakang's diligence.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"► Divine Magic 5 Level/Magic Power 7 (14)","description":""},{"title":"◯ 🗨 ► Magic Aptitude","description":"They can use the Combat Feats [ Targeting ], [ Metamagic/Targets ], and [ Wordbreak ]."},{"title":"⏩ △ Techniques","description":"They may use the [ Cat's Eyes ], [ Beetleskin ], [ Bear Muscle ], and [ Strong Blood ] Techniques."},{"title":"◯ Deadly Poison /11 (18)/Fortitude/Negates","description":"If a Bite attack hits and deals 1 or more points of applied damage, the target receives extra 2d+8 Poison magic damage.\nBody"},{"title":"◯ Convulsive Poison/10 (17)/Fortitude/Negates","description":"If the Tail attack hits, the target receives a -1 penalty to any Skill Checks for 1 minute (6 rounds). This effect is cumulative.\nThis effect is Poison type."},{"title":"◯ Attack Obstacle = +4 • None","description":"Against melee attacks, the Head section receives a +4 bonus to Evasion checks.\nThis effect disappears when the Body section falls to 0 HP or lower.\nWing"},{"title":"◯ Flight","description":"All section receives a +1 bonus to Accuracy and Evasion only for melee attacks.\nIf one of the Wing sections falls to 0 HP or lower, this unique skill cannot be used.\n2d |\nLoot |\nAlways |\nCrystallized Daemon's Blood (800G/Red A) |\n2 - 6 |\nNothing |\n7 - 12 |\nDaemon's Horn (600G/Red A) |\n13+ |\nLarge Daemon's Horn (1,400G/Red S) |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Ragnakang","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":200000}
{"_id":"i8PVVkWIxYAiQZfB","name":"Cerberus","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:cerberus","level":11,"monsterType":"Daemon","intelligence":"Animal","perception":"Five senses (Darkvision)","disposition":"Hostile","soulscars":0,"languages":"None","habitat":"Underground Labyrinth, Ruins, Shallow Abysses","reputation":15,"weakness":20,"weakPoint":"Bludgeoning damage +3 points","initiative":18,"movementSpeed":"20 (4 Legs)","fortitude":"14 (21)","willpower":"13 (20)","source":"CR II p. 408","description":"A three-headed daemon dog, a Cerberus is really more the size of a horse. Able to conjure up breath weapons of fire, ice, and poison, it can be a dangerous foe in combat. Also known as the Watchdog of Hell, Cerberuses are typically seen guarding something, whether the entrance to a labyrinth, a vault inside, or something else. While its intelligence is that of an average dog's, a Cerberus will remain loyal to its orders and will fight to the death to carry them out.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"◯ Fire Immunity","description":"Head"},{"title":"► Three Breaths","description":"Its mouth spits one of the following breaths: Fire Breath, Blizzard Breath, or Noxious Breath. All of them have \"Range: Caster\" and \"Target: 1 area (6m Radius)/20\" around the head.\nThe Head can choose any breath to use (or whether to attack with Bite without using breath). If more than one head breathes the same kind of breath, it is treated as a single attack with increased success value. If two heads breathe the same breath, the breath's success value has a +2 bonus, and the calculated damage is increased by +4. If all three heads breathe the same breath, the success value has a bonus of +4, and the calculated damage is increased by +8.\n1: Fire Breath/11 (18)/Fortitude/Half\nHead exhales fire, dealing 2d+12 Fire magic damage to the affected targets.\n2: Blizzard Breath/10 (17)/Fortitude/Half\nHead spits out a blizzard, dealing 2d+8 Water/Ice magic damage to the targets and reducing their Defense by -5 points for 30 seconds (3 rounds). This Defense reduction is non-cumulative and does not reduce Defense below 0.\n3: Noxious Breath/9 (16)/Fortitude/Half\nHead spits poison, inflicting 2d+6 Poison magic damage to the targets, and each target incurs a -3 penalty to their Evasion checks for 30 seconds (3 rounds). This effect is not cumulative."},{"title":"⏩ △ Techniques","description":"May use the [ Beetleskin ] and [ Bear Muscle ] Techniques.\nBody"},{"title":"◯ Attack Obstacle = +4 • None","description":"Against melee attacks, the Head sections receive a +4 bonus to Evasion checks.\nThis effect disappears when the Body section falls to 0 HP or lower.\n2d |\nLoot |\nAlways |\nCrystallized Daemon's Blood (800G/Red A) |\n2 - 7 |\nNothing |\n8 - 12 |\nBinding Chain (500G/Black A) |\n13+ |\nJet-black Binding Chain (3,000G/Black S) |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Cerberus","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":100000}
{"_id":"iBcEbNPsGQHdeHbb","name":"Selassaroui","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:selassaroui","level":10,"monsterType":"Daemon","intelligence":"Average","perception":"Five senses (Darkvision)","disposition":"Hostile","soulscars":0,"languages":"Trade Common, Barbaric, Daemonic","habitat":"Ruins, Shallow Abysses","reputation":17,"weakness":20,"weakPoint":"Magic damage +2 points","initiative":18,"movementSpeed":"20 (4 Legs)","fortitude":"13 (20)","willpower":"13 (20)","source":"Monstrous Lore p. 207","description":"This Daemon takes the form of a muscular human about 2 meters in height, with two pairs of arms. Countless sharp gem fragments protrude from its body.\n\nIt can produce jeweled spears from its own body and use them as weapons. However, approaching the spear will result in injury from the sharp gems protruding from its body.\n\nThese Daemons may appear as soldiers of higher-ranking Daemons.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"◯ Poison Immunity, ◯ Psychic Immunity","description":""},{"title":"◯ Gem-Smashing","description":"Gems throughout the body shatter with each wound, injuring the opponent.\nAny target that hits with a melee attack or applies a \"Range: Touch\" effect to this monster takes 1d+2 points of fixed damage each time."},{"title":"◯ Multi-arm Stance","description":"The monster can have up to four Jeweled Spears, one for each arm.\nWhen two or more spears are held, the Selassaroui can perform a combination of Melee Attack and [ ► Jeweled Spear Throw] up to two times in total. In this case, it can choose the second attack method and target after seeing the result of the first roll.\nThis monster already has 4 spears at the start of combat. If it loses one due to [ ► Jeweled Spear Throw], it can create a new one with [ ⏩ Create Jeweled Spear]. With only one spear, it can only make one melee attack or [ ► Jeweled Spear Throw]."},{"title":"► Jeweled Spear Throw/13 (20)/Evasion/Negates","description":"The Selassaroui attacks by throwing a spear in its hand.\nThrow has \"Range/Area: 2 (20m)/ Shot \" at \"Target: 1 Character\" and deals 2d+13 physical damage.\nA Jeweled Spear will be shattered and lost regardless of the result of the attack."},{"title":"⏩ Create a Jeweled Spear","description":"Creates a Jeweled Spear in hand. This effect can be used only once per round and costs 8 MP.\n2d |\nLoot |\nAlways |\nCrushed Gemstone Powder (1,600G) |\n2 - 8 |\nNothing |\n9 - 12 |\nGem (600G/Gold A) x 1d |\n13+ |\nGem (600G/Gold A) x 2d |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Selassaroui","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"jL4WPdchw5V0Hf3F","name":"Aetherbeast","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:aetherbeast","level":4,"monsterType":"Daemon","intelligence":"Low","perception":"Five senses (Darkvision)","disposition":"Hostile","soulscars":0,"languages":"Daemonic","habitat":"Labyrinths","reputation":12,"weakness":15,"weakPoint":"Physical damage +2 points","initiative":12,"movementSpeed":"14 (4 Legs)","fortitude":"5 (12)","willpower":"5 (12)","source":"CR I p. 429","description":"Beasts from another world, Aetherbeasts are loyal to and follow around other daemons. Often taking the appearance of a much larger wolf, they will savagely bite any who threaten them. While the stats given are for this particular form, GMs may also use other stats to represent other Aetherbeast forms.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Aetherbeast","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":200000}
{"_id":"jSldyLenhwqb4xFq","name":"Rigogan","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:rigogan","level":13,"monsterType":"Daemon","intelligence":"Average","perception":"Five senses (Darkvision)","disposition":"Hostile","soulscars":0,"languages":"Trade Common, Daemonic","habitat":"Labyrinths, Ruins","reputation":18,"weakness":21,"weakPoint":"Bludgeoning type damage +3","initiative":20,"movementSpeed":"15","fortitude":"18 (25)","willpower":"16 (23)","source":"Monstrous Lore p. 211","description":"It is a Daemon with a huge bow; its entire body is covered with numerous hard thorns. This Daemon pulls out these spines by itself and uses them as arrows.\n\nUnusually for Daemons, it prefers a fair fight. It prefers to avoid making a surprise attack and always start a fight when they can see each other. However, they have no hesitation in opening battle with an opponent who has only melee weapons, calling out from a distance of 50 meters, saying, \"Come on, let's play it fair\" (the argument being that it is worse to have no means of a long-range attack and may wait for them searching a bow).","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"◯ Targeting &amp; Hawk Eye","description":"It is possible to select a character in a melee area as a target for the \"Area: Line\" effect without causing misfiring.\nIt also can aim through a skirmish to attack enemies beyond."},{"title":"► Bow","description":"Makes a Shooting Attack with a Bow at \"Range: 2 (50m)\". Accuracy check and damage are the same as in the normal attack."},{"title":"► Heavy Bow/17 (24)/Evasion/Negates","description":"Rigogan draws its bow and fires with terrible force. Shooting attack with \"Range/Area: 2 (50m) / Line \", those failing Evasion checks suffer 2d+20 physical damage.\nThis ability cannot be used on consecutive turns."},{"title":"► Rapid Fire Bow/17 (24)/Evasion/Negates","description":"Makes Shooting Attack with \"Range: 2 (20m)\" on any 5 targets, dealing 2d+13 physical damage."},{"title":"◯ Final Arrow/19 (26)/Evasion/Negates","description":"If this monster's HP is 0 or less, its body thorns will scatter in an explosion. Within \"Range: Caster\" and \"Target: All areas (30m radius) / All\" targets are hit by 2d+20 points of physical damage.\nThis ability can be activated only once, after which the monster dies automatically.\n2d |\nLoot |\nAlways |\nCrystallized Daemon's Blood (800G/Red A) |\nAlways |\nWell-Kept Weapon (1,000G/Black White S) |\nAlways |\nDaemon's Arrowhead (100G/Black White A) x 2d |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Rigogan","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"lT4G46SXMFsPXro0","name":"Lunzemase","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:lunzemase","level":12,"monsterType":"Daemon","intelligence":"High","perception":"Five senses (Darkvision)","disposition":"Hostile","soulscars":0,"languages":"Daemonic","habitat":"Various","reputation":19,"weakness":23,"weakPoint":"Accuracy +1","initiative":19,"movementSpeed":"24","fortitude":"15 (22)","willpower":"16 (23)","source":"CR II p. 409","description":"This Daemon wears a giant wooden mask reminiscent of a shield and has a body that looks like layers of strong fibers bound together. The mask is decorated with a pattern of straight lines that affect the creature's spirit if one tries to look at it.\n\nAs sparkling fibers make it difficult to see Lunzemase, powerful weapon attacks mercilessly reap the lives of creatures while dazzled.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"◯ 2 Actions","description":"Can perform two Major Actions in one round."},{"title":"◯ Multiple Declarations = 2 times","description":""},{"title":"◯ Sparkling Fibers","description":"It isn't easy to see a Lunzenmase from a distance. A character who is more than \"Range: 1 (10m)\" away from this monster receives a -2 penalty on checks (Accuracy check, Spellcasting check, Performance check, etc.) when making ranged attacks, casting a spell, Finale, and other unique skills that require visibility of this monster."},{"title":"► Twin Strike &amp; Double Attack","description":"Can make two Weapon attacks each round, though each attack requires its own Accuracy check. They may choose to attack different characters with each attack."},{"title":"🗨 Abyss Blade","description":"If the target is hit by a Weapon attack, the target's Defense is halved for that attack (rounded up). At risk, the monster takes a -1 penalty to Evasion checks.\n2d |\nLoot |\nAlways |\nCrystallized Daemon's Blood (800G/Red A) |\nAlways |\nIncomprehensible Mask (2,000G/Black White S) |\n2 - 12 |\nDaemon's Fiber (1,100G/Green S) |\n13+ |\nLustrous Daemon's Fiber (4,400G/Gold Green S) |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Lunzemase","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"lTjqGz5Y10pcT0no","name":"Endertuz","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:endertuz","level":17,"monsterType":"Daemon","intelligence":"High","perception":"Five senses (Darkvision)","disposition":"Hostile","soulscars":0,"languages":"Trade Common, Daemonic, Arcana","habitat":"Ruins","reputation":26,"weakness":28,"weakPoint":"Bludgeoning damage +3 points","initiative":23,"movementSpeed":"15","fortitude":"21 (28)","willpower":"23 (30)","source":"CR III p. 425","description":"This is a higher Daemon that looks like a maiden holding a pearl with countless ivies entwined around her. The maiden is said to have taken the body of a person who was once sacrificed to this Daemon. The Maiden enjoys showing herself to make others hesitate to attack her or to make them feel guilty. At first glance, it looks like a Plant, but the main section is the central pearl, and the ivies and the maiden accompany it to protect it.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"◯ 🗨 Magic Aptitude","description":"They can use the Combat Feats [ Targeting ], [ Magic Convergence ], [ Magic Control ], [ Universal Metamagic ], [ Double Cast ], and [ Rune Master ]."},{"title":"◯ Knowledge &amp; Weakness Exploit","description":"Endertuz can make Sage Knowledge checks with standard value 18 (25 fixed value).\nEndertuz deals double damage to other monster weak points it detected.\nMaiden"},{"title":"► Spiritualism Magic 15 Level/Magic Power 21 (28)","description":""},{"title":"⏩ Open Eyes/ ⏩ Close Eyes","description":"The Maiden section has different abilities depending on its eyes condition. When the eyes are closed, the Maiden section is treated as blind (other sections still have eyesight).\nThe [ ⏩ Open Eyes] and [ ⏩ Close Eyes] can be performed only once before the Main section performs the Major Action."},{"title":"◯ Attack Obstacle = +4 • +4","description":"The maiden is holding the pearl and shielding it.\nThe Pearl section gains a +4 bonus to Evasion checks against melee and ranged attacks.\nThis effect disappears when the Maiden section falls to 0 HP or lower."},{"title":"◯ Lovely Figure/22 (29)/Willpower/Negates","description":"It binds adversaries with guilt and inhibits their actions.\nA character who inflicts 1 or more applied damage by a melee attack to the Maiden section and fails a Willpower check cannot take any Major or Minor Actions for the following 1 minute (6 rounds).\nThis effect is only active when the Maiden has her eyes closed and is automatically canceled when the Maiden opens her eyes.\nThis effect is Psychic type."},{"title":"◯ Praying Maiden (Only When Eyes Closed)","description":"Maiden and Pears sections heal HP and MP by 10 points at the end of their turn."},{"title":"◯ Raging Maiden (Only When Eyes Open)","description":"The Maiden section is treated as having acquired the following Combat Feats (in addition to those of [ ◯ 🗨 Magic Aptitude]):\n[ Multi-Action ], [ Mana Strike ], and [ Battle Master ].\nPearl"},{"title":"◯ Truespeech Magic 15 Level/Magic Power 21 (28)","description":""},{"title":"◯ Mana Resistance","description":"Reduce all Magic Damage Pearl section received by -5.\nIvy"},{"title":"◯ Attack Obstacle = Impossible • Impossible","description":"Tangled ivy hinders attacks.\nThe Maiden and Pearl sections cannot be targeted by a melee or ranged attacks.\nThis unique skill is lost when two or more Ivy sections have 0 or fewer HP."},{"title":"◯ Coordinated Attack","description":"If an attack on an Ivy section is evaded, the other section's attacks on that target gain a +1 to the Accuracy check against that target. This modifier is accumulated for each evaded attack. However, once any section attack hits or the monster's turn is ended, it is lost.\n2d |\nLoot |\nAlways |\nCrystallized Great Daemon's Blood (1,600G/Red S) |\nAlways |\nBroken Pearl (350G/Gold Black A) |\nAlways |\nMemento (1,000G/White S) |\nAlways |\nFlexible Ivy (2,200G/Green S) x 2d |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Endertuz","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"mHbSXNFaEOlkNHLx","name":"Agare","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:agare","level":5,"monsterType":"Daemon","intelligence":"Low","perception":"Five Senses","disposition":"Hostile","soulscars":0,"languages":"Daemonic","habitat":"Ruins, Shallow Abysses","reputation":12,"weakness":15,"weakPoint":"Accuracy +1","initiative":13,"movementSpeed":"14(Many Legs)","fortitude":"7 (14)","willpower":"7 (14)","source":"DL","description":"This Daemon looks like a human without a body from the waist down. Instead of legs, it has four pairs of long, jointed legs from its flanks and moves in a spider-like form.\n\nIts head is red and enlarged, but it has no eyes or ears and perceives everything with its nose. In combat, it attacks by thrusting its legs, but when it concentrates on attacking, it slows down and creates an opening.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"◯ Attitude Control","description":"Agare cannot fall prone."},{"title":"► Multi-Legged Attack &amp; Twin Strike","description":"Agare can make two Leg attacks each round. They may choose to attack different characters with each attack.\nIf the second attack is made as a risk, it gains a -2 penalty to Evasion and Willpower.\n2d |\nLoot |\nAlways |\nDaemon's Blood (100G/Red A) |\n2 - 6 |\nNothing |\n7 - 10 |\nDaemon's Sharp Legs (170G/Red A) |\n11+ |\nDaemon's Razor Legs (530G/Red A) |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Agare","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":100000}
{"_id":"muKvhvT51nJEKDhd","name":"Foregone","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:foregone","level":13,"monsterType":"Daemon","intelligence":"High","perception":"Five senses (Darkvision)","disposition":"Hostile","soulscars":0,"languages":"Trade Common, Daemonic","habitat":"Labyrinths, Ruins","reputation":18,"weakness":22,"weakPoint":"Magic damage +2 points","initiative":19,"movementSpeed":"16","fortitude":"17 (24)","willpower":"17 (24)","source":"CR III p. 421","description":"A lesser daemon, Foregones are 6m tall giants, with red-black skin, with one horn protruding from their forehead and the lower body of a goat.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"► Divine Magic 12 Level/Magic Power 16 (23)","description":""},{"title":"🗨 ► Magic Aptitude","description":"A Foregone can use the Combat Feats [ Metamagic/Targets ], [ Multi- Action ], and [ Wordbreak ].\nBody"},{"title":"► Twin Strike &amp; Double Attack","description":"A Foregone can make two Claws attacks each round. They may choose to attack different characters with each attack."},{"title":"◯ Attack Obstacle = Impossible • +4","description":"Foregone size hinders attack.\nThe Head cannot be attacked in melee. Against any ranged attacks, Head receives a +4 bonus to Evasion checks.\nWhen the Body falls to 0 HP or lower, this effect disappears.\nLegs"},{"title":"◯ Kneel","description":"If the HP of the Legs section is less than 0, the Body section receives a - 2 penalty on Accuracy and Evasion checks.\n2d |\nLoot |\nAlways |\nCrystallized Daemon's Blood (800G/Red A) |\n2 - 8 |\nNothing |\n9 - 12 |\nDaemon's Horn (600G/Red A) |\n13+ |\nLarge Daemon's Horn (1,400G/Red S) |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Foregone","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"mzj6cUaA9Wp3vV5i","name":"Espiraco","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:espiraco","level":3,"monsterType":"Daemon","intelligence":"Low","perception":"Magic","disposition":"Hostile","soulscars":0,"languages":"None","habitat":"Caves, Shallow Abysses","reputation":11,"weakness":14,"weakPoint":"Physical Damage +2 Points","initiative":9,"movementSpeed":"10 (Crawling)","fortitude":"4 (11)","willpower":"4 (11)","source":"Natural History of Dorden p. 131","description":"This is a Daemon with deep spiral grooves, about 1m in length, shaped like a coconut. It rotates its entire body sharply and burrows into earthen walls or the ground to hide.\n\nThere have been sightings of it as a precursor to, or during, the Shallowing of caves and natural environments. It looks like a large insect and doesn't use language, but it is believed to possess some degree of intellect, such as efficiently targeting weakened individuals in groups or following instructions from other Daemons.\n\nThe body fluid that can be extracted has high nutritional value and is favored as a delicacy by some gourmets.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"►Dissolving Fluid / 4 (11) / Fortitude / Half","description":"With \"Range: Touch,\" it spits dissolving fluid from its mouth at 1 target character. The target takes 1d+2 points of Poison magic damage.\nThis ability cannot be used in consecutive turns."},{"title":"⏩Underground Movement/Escape","description":"It burrows its body into earthen walls or the ground. While burrowing, it cannot move except with \"Limited Move,\" and its gains a +1 bonus to Evasion. Additionally, it cannot be perceived by characters in different areas (Simplified Combat) or outside the skirmish area (Standard Combat, Advanced Combat).\nWhile burrowing, it cannot perform any Major Action other than [►Dissolving Fluid]. This ability can only be used once per round."},{"title":"◯Delicate Loot","description":"If its HP drops to 0 or below while burrowing using the [⏩Underground Movement] ability, the \"Stimulating Sauce\" loot is lost.\n2d |\nLoot |\nAlways |\nStimulating Sauce (160G/Red A) |\nAlways |\nDaemon's Blood (160G/Red A) |\n2 - 10 |\nNothing |\n11+ |\nAbyss Shard (200G/-) |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Espiraco","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":200000}
{"_id":"nSeeXfuf6vjz29kg","name":"Aprerousa","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:aprerousa","level":11,"monsterType":"Daemon","intelligence":"High","perception":"Magic","disposition":"Hostile","soulscars":0,"languages":"Arcana, Daemonic","habitat":"Shallows","reputation":18,"weakness":21,"weakPoint":"Physical damage +2 points","initiative":18,"movementSpeed":"-/10 (Floating)","fortitude":"14 (21)","willpower":"14 (21)","source":"AB, p. 125","description":"This Greater Daemon appears as if it has giant faces mounted on the four ends of a 5-meter-tall candelabra that resembles an ancient tree. Each face floats and flickers at the ends of the candelabra, freely interchanging positions while dramatically changing their expressions each time.\n\nThe four faces constantly speak meaningless words with different expressions, and their utterances are incomprehensible to ordinary people. It is said that communication becomes possible when all faces show the same expression, but there have been no witnessed instances of such a moment.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"◯Curse Immunity","description":""},{"title":"◯MP Sharing","description":"When any section consumes MP, it will be deducted from Candlestick section's MP.\nCandlestick"},{"title":"◯Otherworldly Body","description":"It does not receive critical hits from any weapon or magical attacks."},{"title":"◯Magic Power Restoration = 20 points","description":"At the start of its turn, MP is instantly restored by 20 points. This effect cannot restore MP beyond its maximum value.\nFirst Face / Second Face / Third Face / Fourth Face"},{"title":"►Magic (4 Systems) 11 Level / Magic Power 13 (20)","description":"Has learned one system each from different systems: Truespeech Magic , Spiritualism Magic , Divine Magic (Laris) , and Fairy Magic .\nThe types used in Fairy Magic are Earth, Fire, Water/Ice, and Dark. This remains unchanged even when using the contract rules (see MA, p. 136)."},{"title":"◯🗨Magic Aptitude","description":"They can use Combat Feats [ Targeting ], [ Magic Convergence ], and [ Magic Control ]."},{"title":"⏩Berserk Form","description":"Severely transforms appearance to increase mana. For 3 minutes (18 rounds), Magic Power increases by +1 point. This effect can only be used once per round, and accumulates during the effect duration when used (maximum +4).\nWhen this ability is used, magic cannot be cast until the next turn. Additionally, when magic is cast, this ability cannot be used. Using this ability consumes 5 HP points. Translator's Note: This effect and cost are tracked as usual per section, not per monster.\nFirst Face"},{"title":"◯Ray Attack","description":"Ray attacks are treated as Energy magic damage with \"Range/Area: 2 (30m) / Shot .\"\nSecond Face"},{"title":"◯Painful Strike","description":"If the result of 2d damage roll is 10 or higher, add an additional +10 points of damage.\nThird Face"},{"title":"◯Poison / 13 (20) / Fortitude / Negates","description":"When a Saliva attack hits, the target receives a -2 penalty to Willpower for 10 seconds (1 round).\nFourth Face"},{"title":"►Enveloping","description":"Covers and obscures vision by overlapping with faces other than its own. When this ability is used on one of its own First Face/Second Face/Third Face, Fourth Face becomes invisible to other characters for 10 seconds (1 round) and is automatically excluded from wide-area effects that have maximum targets.\n2d |\nLoot |\nAlways |\nCrystallized Daemon's Blood (800G/Red A) x 5 |\nAlways |\nAbyss Shard (200G/-) x 5 |\n2 - 6 |\nNothing |\n7 - 10 |\nLamenting Face (500G/Black White A) |\n11+ |\nAngry Face (1,800G/Black White S) |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Aprerousa","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":400000}
{"_id":"nVumVuWSsyKO4GMl","name":"Melbiz","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:melbiz","level":10,"monsterType":"Daemon","intelligence":"Average","perception":"Five senses (Darkvision)","disposition":"Hostile","soulscars":0,"languages":"Daemonic","habitat":"Labyrinths, Ruins","reputation":16,"weakness":20,"weakPoint":"Fire damage + 3 points","initiative":16,"movementSpeed":"13/20 (Swimming)","fortitude":"13 (20)","willpower":"12 (19)","source":"CR III p. 419","description":"Melbiz is a low-rank daemon adapted to water, sporting shiny green scales and a dorsal fin. Standing just slightly taller than an average human at 2.5m tall, they are adapted to the water and will sneak into civilized lands through rivers and canals. High-ranking daemons will often use a contingent of Melbiz to spearhead an attack, coming from the water to attack unsuspecting cities.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"◯ Poison Immunity, ◯ Disease Immunity","description":""},{"title":"◯ Underwater Aptitude","description":"Upper Body"},{"title":"► Twin Strike &amp; Double Attack","description":"A Melbiz can make two Claws attacks each round. They may choose to attack different characters with each attack."},{"title":"► Acid Saliva/12 (19)/Evasion/Neg, Underwater/Can't","description":"The Melbiz spits a gob of acid with \"Range/Area: 2 (20m) / Shot \" and \"Target: 1 Character\" and deals 2d+7 Poison physical damage. In addition, the target's armor and defense are damaged.\nIf the target is a character that has PC data, the Defense of any equipped armor or shield chosen by the target must be reduced by -1.\nThis effect is cumulative, and if Defense becomes 0, it will be completely destroyed. Armor with reduced Defense can be repaired by paying 10% (up to 90%) of the armor's price for each reduction.\nEach time a character with the monster data is affected by this effect, its Defense is reduced by -1. The effect is cumulative but only down to 0. Defense is restored by +1 point per day.\nIf this ability is used underwater, the acid will dissolve and spread in the water, having \"Range: Caster\", \"Target: 1 area (5m Radius) / 15\", and \"Resistance: Can't\" and deal 2d Poison magic damage. This form of attack cannot be evaded but also does not damage armor.\nThis unique skill cannot be used on consecutive turns.\n2d |\nLoot |\nAlways |\nCrystallized Daemon's Blood (800G/Red A) |\n2 - 8 |\nNothing |\n9 - 12 |\nDaemon's Horn (600G/Red A) |\n13+ |\nGreen Scales (1,600G/Gold Red S) |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Melbiz","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"ngKldYRtwoQaHxHQ","name":"Doppelganger","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:doppelganger","level":15,"monsterType":"Daemon","intelligence":"High","perception":"Five senses (Darkvision)","disposition":"Hostile","soulscars":0,"languages":"Trade Common, Arcana, Daemonic","habitat":"Labyrinths, Ruins","reputation":19,"weakness":23,"weakPoint":"Slashing damage +3 points","initiative":21,"movementSpeed":"18","fortitude":"21 (28)","willpower":"21 (28)","source":"CR III p. 423","description":"One of the high-rank daemons, a Doppelganger's base form, is that of a black-skinned giant 3m tall. A single red line splits the face where its mouth would be, but its face is otherwise featureless. This Daemon has the ability to shapeshift into any target it has observed, and its usual method is to kill the target, take its place, and enter the Humanoid society to plot secret evil, causing suspicion and confusion in the society.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"► Shapeshift","description":"The Doppelganger can change its shape into another's, with the quality of the transformation based on the time the Doppelganger has observed the target. A quick glance at a target allows the Doppelganger to copy the target's physical appearance, including any belongings. One minute's observation (6 rounds) allows for copying the target's tone and mannerisms, while one hour's observation gives a complete copy of the target's abilities and memory. This last transformation will also allow the Doppelganger access to any Classes and spells the target may have learned. This unique skill lasts until the Doppelganger reverts to its base form, taking Major Action to do so.\nUpper Body"},{"title":"► Truespeech Magic 15 Level/Magic Power 21 (28)","description":""},{"title":"◯ 🗨 ► Magic Aptitude","description":"A Doppelganger can use the Combat Feats [ Targeting ], [ Magic Convergence ], [ Magic Control ], [ Metamagic/Targets ], [ Multi-Action ], [ Rune Master ], and [ Wordbreak ].\nLower Body"},{"title":"◯ Attack Obstacle = +4 • None","description":"Against melee attacks, the Upper Body section receives a +4 bonus to Evasion checks.\nThis effect disappears when the Lower Body section falls to 0 HP or lower.\n2d |\nLoot |\nAlways |\nCrystallized Great Daemon's Blood (1,600G/Red S) |\n2 - 7 |\nNothing |\n8 - 12 |\nBlack Hide (4,600G/Red S) |\n13+ |\nShadowy Hide (12,000G/Red SS) |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Doppelganger","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"q0MksJDa7fV3jxx0","name":"Kekkubak","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:kekkubak","level":4,"monsterType":"Daemon","intelligence":"Low","perception":"Five senses (Darkvision)","disposition":"Hostile","soulscars":0,"languages":"Daemonic, Sylvan","habitat":"Shallow Abysses","reputation":12,"weakness":15,"weakPoint":"Slashing type damage +3","initiative":11,"movementSpeed":"13","fortitude":"5 (12)","willpower":"6 (13)","source":"KF","description":"This is a Daemon that can use Fairy Magic. It is approximately one meter long and looks like a thin old man, but its face resembles that of a bird of prey.\n\nIt can create a space that mysteriously reverberates magic and delights in disrupting it. It casts Fairy Magic, which is believed to be different in principle from the Fairy Magic used by Humanoid and others.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"► Fairy Magic 3 Level / Magic Power 5 (12)","description":"It can use Earth and Fire types."},{"title":"◯ Magic Aptitude","description":"They can use the Combat Feat [ Targeting ]."},{"title":"⏩ Spell Echo/Can't","description":"Within \"Range: Caster\" and \"Target: All Areas (Radius 30m)/Space,\" Kekkubak creates a mysterious space in which it repeats spells.\nFor 10 seconds (1 round), when any characters in the affected area cast a spell with \"Target: 1 Character\", another character is selected at random at the same time.\nA random character is selected from the characters existing within the effect's area, excluding the original target and ignoring the spell's original range and shielding. If the spell is expanded by [ Metamagic/Targets ], this effect repeats for each target.\nUsing this unique skill costs 5 points of MP.\n2d |\nLoot |\nAlways |\nDaemon's Blood (100G/Red A) |\n2 - 5 |\nNothing |\n6+ |\nDaemon's Blood (100G/Red A) |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Kekkubak","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":400000}
{"_id":"rK3ojwyERwDrFiHW","name":"Argagis","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:argagis","level":7,"monsterType":"Daemon","intelligence":"Low","perception":"Five senses (Darkvision)","disposition":"Hostile","soulscars":0,"languages":"Daemonic","habitat":"Labyrinths, Ruins","reputation":13,"weakness":16,"weakPoint":"Water/Ice damage +3 points","initiative":14,"movementSpeed":"15 (4 Legs)","fortitude":"10 (17)","willpower":"9 (16)","source":"CR II p. 405","description":"Argagis is a Daemon that resembles an armadillo covered with a hard shell. It is characterized by its extreme strength and sturdiness. Its defense is further strengthened by its rounded back, which forms a considerable sphere that crushes its enemies. It does not have a high intellect and often follows other Daemons as a guard.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"◯ Multiple Declarations = 2 times","description":""},{"title":"◯ Continuous Attack","description":"If a monster successfully hits a target in melee, it may make a second attack against the same target."},{"title":"🗨 Ball Roll","description":"Argagis increases its Defense by +3 points and movement by +15m. At the same time, its damage is reduced by -3."},{"title":"🗨 △ Cover I","description":"Can use [ Cover I ] combat feat."},{"title":"🗨 All-Out Attack","description":"A Slam can deal an additional 8 damage on its next attack. However, any Evasion check made by this section this turn receives a -3 penalty as a risk.\n2d |\nLoot |\nAlways |\nDaemon's Blood (100G/Red A) |\n2 - 10 |\nSturdy Shell (200G/Red A) |\n11+ |\nHigh-Quality Shell (1,200G/Red S) |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Argagis","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":100000}
{"_id":"rWlSKGOLTXhV8Lrn","name":"Bugaradre","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:bugaradre","level":10,"monsterType":"Daemon","intelligence":"Average","perception":"Five Senses (Darkvision)","disposition":"Hostile","soulscars":0,"languages":"Daemonic","habitat":"Swamps, Ruins","reputation":16,"weakness":20,"weakPoint":"Fire Damage +3","initiative":16,"movementSpeed":"10/-","fortitude":"14 (21)","willpower":"13 (20)","source":"BM","description":"This Daemon has long arms, a burly body, and large horns on its head. They are as tall as 5 meters, and their arms are as thick and sturdy as logs.\n\nBugaradre's poisons, which are released from his shoulders, have the power to destroy anything and everything. Almost anything except stone and metal will melt away and turn into a swamp. This swamp will have the same poisonous gas as Bugaradre itself.\n\nBugaradre feels compelled to expand the swamp, moving about it and corrupting its surroundings. One unchecked Bugaradre can destroy a nation.\n\nOnce a swamp has been created, it can only be patiently purified with [ Cure Poison ] or [ Purification ], or it will recover naturally in decades or centuries.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"◯ Poison &amp; Disease Immunity","description":"Body"},{"title":"► Spiritualism Magic 8 Level/Magic Power 10 (17)","description":""},{"title":"◯ 🗨 ► Magical Aptitude","description":"The Bugaradre can use the Combat Feats [ Targeting ], [ Universal Metamagic ], and [ Wordbreak ]."},{"title":"◯ Noxious Gas / 13 (20) / Fortitude / Negates","description":"Within \"Range: Caster\" and \"Target: 1 area (3m Radius/Space)\" Bugaradre is surrounded by pale purple poisonous gas. Characters within the above range receive 3 Poison magic damage at the start of their turn."},{"title":"► Putrid Poison Shell / 13 (20) / Fortitude / Negates","description":"Fires projectiles filled with deadly poison from the humps on both its shoulders within \"Range/Area: 2 (30m) / Shot \", scattering poisonous liquid in \"Target: 1 Area (6m radius / 20)\". A struck target receives 2d+5 points of Poison magic damage for every Normal Move, Full Move, and Major Action it performs thereafter (without Fortitude checks). This effect is of the Poison type, permanent, and is not cumulative.\nThe Demon's Detoxification Gland loot received from this monster automatically removes the effect of the poison (one gland per person).\nArm"},{"title":"◯ Substitution","description":"When the Body suffers damage from a melee or ranged attack, an Arm can take the damage instead. The applied damage to the Body applied as- is to the Arm (without recalculation). This unique skill can only be used once per round for each Arm.\nBugaradre cannot be used against melee attacks or ranged attacks that have multiple targets at the same time."},{"title":"🗨 Cleave I","description":"It can attack up to 3 characters that can be reached with melee attacks, but the damage will be reduced by -3."},{"title":"◯ Regeneration = 5 Points","description":"At the end of each round, an Arm recovers 5 HP. This has no effect if this Arm section has 0 HP or lower.\n2d |\nLoot |\nAlways |\nCrystallized Daemon's Blood (800G/Red A) |\nAlways |\nDaemon's Detoxification Gland (300G / Red A) x 1d |\n2 - 8 |\nDaemon's Horn (600G/Red A) |\n9+ |\nLarge Daemon's Horn (1,400G/Red S) |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Bugaradre","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"rjkzOq2NDEVngjFr","name":"Lada Adroda","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:lada-adroda","level":16,"monsterType":"Daemon","intelligence":"High","perception":"Five senses (Darkvision)","disposition":"Hostile","soulscars":0,"languages":"Trade Common, Daemonic","habitat":"Labyrinths, Ruins","reputation":19,"weakness":24,"weakPoint":"Slashing damage +3 points","initiative":22,"movementSpeed":"15/20(Flying)","fortitude":"22 (29)","willpower":"21 (28)","source":"CR III p. 424","description":"Lada Adroda is a high-ranking daemon in the same family as the Ragnakang . However, the Lada Adroda is much larger and has two heads instead of one. These daemons are commonly seen as commanders of daemon attacks and incursions, and hundreds of lesser daemons wait at their disposal.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"◯ Poison Immunity, ◯ Disease Immunity","description":"Head"},{"title":"► Divine Magic 15 Level/Magic Power 21 (28)","description":""},{"title":"◯ 🗨 ► Magic Aptitude","description":"A Lada Adroda can use the Combat Feats [ Targeting ], [Magic Convergence], [ Magic Control ], [ Metamagic/Targets ], [ Hawk Eye ], [ Multi- Action ], [ Rune Master ], and [ Wordbreak ]."},{"title":"⏩ △ Techniques","description":"A Lada Adroda can use the [ Gazelle Feet ], [ Cat's Eyes ], [ Recovery (10 pts.) ], [ Scale Leggings ], [ Strong Blood ], [ Beetleskin ], [ Bear Muscle ]], [ Centaur Legs ], [ Giant Arms ] and [ Daemonfinger ] Techniques."},{"title":"◯ Deadly Poison/22 (29)/Fortitude/Negates","description":"If a Bite attack hits and deals 1 or more points of applied damage, the target receives extra 2d+12 Poison magic damage.\nBody"},{"title":"► Twin Strike &amp; Double Attack","description":"A Lady Adroda can make two Claws attacks each round. They may choose to attack different characters with each attack."},{"title":"◯ Attack Obstacle = +4 • None","description":"Against melee attacks, the Head section receives a +4 bonus to Evasion checks.\nThis effect disappears when the Body section falls to 0 HP or lower.\nWing"},{"title":"◯ Flight","description":"All sections receive a +1 bonus to Accuracy and Evasion only for melee attacks.\nIf one of the Wings falls to 0 HP or lower, this unique skill cannot be used.\nTail"},{"title":"🗨 Tail Sweep","description":"The monster can use its tail to attack up to 5 targets in the same skirmish. An Accuracy check is made on all characters at once, and damage is determined individually.\nThis attack cannot be used in consecutive rounds.\n2d |\nLoot |\nAlways |\nCrystallized Great Daemon's Blood (1,600G/Red S) |\n2 - 7 |\nNothing |\n8 - 12 |\nGreat Daemon's Horn (4,800G/Red S) |\n13+ |\nLarge Great Daemon's Horn (12,900G/Red SS) |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Lada Adroda","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"rzp92OeSjiSy9Yu2","name":"Barusa Biyone","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:barusa-biyone","level":15,"monsterType":"Daemon","intelligence":"High","perception":"Five senses (Darkvision)","disposition":"Hostile","soulscars":0,"languages":"Daemonic","habitat":"Labyrinths, Ruins","reputation":19,"weakness":23,"weakPoint":"Fire damage +3 points","initiative":20,"movementSpeed":"20","fortitude":"22 (29)","willpower":"20 (27)","source":"Monstrous Lore p. 214","description":"Barusa Biyone is an upper Daemon that takes the form of an upright white bear wearing black full-body armor. It stands 7 meters tall and has glowing red eyes, like a bright fire.\n\nLegend has it that it lived in a frozen place in the Daemon world where everything was at absolute zero, which may explain its preference for silence (oddly enough, the armor that covers its entire body makes no sound). If anything disturbs the silence, it will attack mercilessly.\n\nBarusa Biyone is immensely confident in its armor and is accustomed to mocking those who cannot break it, treating them like small insects. However, if an enemy manages to break its armor, Barusa Biyone will acknowledge them and destroy them first.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"◯ Poison Immunity, ◯ Disease Immunity, ◯ Water/Ice Immunity","description":""},{"title":"◯ Margin of Strength","description":"The [ ► Blizzard Breath], [ 🗨 Power Strike II], and [ ⏩ Mobile Form] abilities are not used until any section has less than 100 HP.\nHead"},{"title":"► Blizzard Breath/18 (25)/Fortitude/Half","description":"The Barusa Biyone vomits a mass of cold air with \"Range/Area: 2 (30m)/ Shot \" in \"Target: 1 area (Radius 6m)/20\", dealing 2d+20 Water/Ice magic damage.\nThis unique skill cannot be used on consecutive turns."},{"title":"► Soul Freezing Roar/17 (24)/Willpower/Negates","description":"Barusa Biyone lets out a soul-chilling roar, terrifying everone within \"Range: Caster\" \"Target: All Areas (Radius 30m)/All\". The target must move farther than 30 meters from Barusa Biyone if possible, or if movement is not enough, Full Move to get as far away as possible. Any affected character in a skirmish must always declare to withdraw. The affected targets cannot attack Barusa Biyone with melee or ranged attacks, nor can it be directly targeted by the \"Target: 1 Character\" magic or effects.\nThis effect lasts only for 10 seconds (1 round) and is Psychic type.\nBody"},{"title":"◯ Multiple Declarations = 2 times","description":""},{"title":"🗨 Power Strike II","description":"A Barusa Biyone can deal an additional +12 damage on their next attack. However, any Evasion Check made by them this turn receives a -2 penalty."},{"title":"► Twin Strike &amp; Double Attack","description":"A Barusa Biyone can make two Iron Claws attacks each round. They may choose to attack different characters with each attack."},{"title":"⏩ Mobile Form","description":"The armor covering the entire body transforms, making it easier to move and attack. The Body section gains a +4 bonus for Accuracy, Evasion, and +4 for Damage. At the same time, Defense is reduced by -10.\nThis unique skill, once used, cannot be deactivated until the combat is over.\nLegs"},{"title":"◯ Attack Obstacle = Impossible, +4 &amp; +4 • None","description":"Barusa Biyone's size precludes attacks. The Head section cannot be the target of melee attacks and gains a +4 bonus on Evasion checks against ranged attacks.\nThe Body section receives a +4 bonus to Evasion checks against melee attacks.\nWhen the Legs fall to 0 HP or lower, this effect disappears.\n2d |\nLoot |\nAlways |\nCrystallized Great Daemon's Blood (1,600G/Red S) |\n2 - 7 |\nNothing |\n8 - 12 |\nJet Black Helmet (5,000G/Black White S) |\n13+ |\nJet Black Armor (12,000G/Black White SS) |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Barusa Biyone","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"vVH8WpU7A47toWtS","name":"Dusky Grace","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:dusky-grace","level":5,"monsterType":"Daemon","intelligence":"Average","perception":"Five senses (Darkvision)","disposition":"Hostile","soulscars":0,"languages":"Daemonic","habitat":"Underground Labyrinth, Ruins","reputation":12,"weakness":17,"weakPoint":"Physical Damage +2","initiative":14,"movementSpeed":"16","fortitude":"6 (13)","willpower":"7 (14)","source":"BM","description":"A Dusky Grace is, compared to other Daemons, rather small. It resembles a short human, with pale grey skin and an elongated, prehensile tail.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"► Spiritualism Magic 3 Level/Magic Power 6 (13)","description":""},{"title":"◯ Entangling Tail","description":"A successful hit from a Tail entangles the target. The target is unable to move, suffers a -2 penalty to all Accuracy and Evasion Checks with a -2 penalty (this penalty is not cumulative) and is automatically hit by the Tail attack each round.\nWhen the target tries to escape, use de-bonding (see ML, p. 71).\nWhile entangled by this unique skill, the Dusky Grace cannot attack other characters. If the monster itself wants to release the target, it can do so with a Minor Action.\n2d |\nLoot |\nAlways |\nDaemon's Blood (100G/Red A) |\n2 - 8 |\nNothing |\n9 - 10 |\nDaemon's Earrings (260G/Gold White A) |\n11+ |\nDaemon's Ring (600G/Gold White A) |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Dusky Grace","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":200000}
{"_id":"xDoWRIaLkRXaROs1","name":"Lilim","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:lilim","level":6,"monsterType":"Daemon","intelligence":"Average","perception":"Five Senses","disposition":"Hostile","soulscars":0,"languages":"Daemonic, Trade Common, Arcana","habitat":"Ruins, Magical Areas, Cities","reputation":13,"weakness":17,"weakPoint":"Accuracy +1","initiative":15,"movementSpeed":"16/-","fortitude":"8 (15)","willpower":"9 (16)","source":"ES, Battle Mastery 148","description":"A Lesser Daemon that looks like an adorable young girl at first glance. They seem cute, but this is merely a disguise to throw off Humanoids, and their true nature is that of a very dangerous Daemon. They specialize in insidious acts of corruption and destruction, deceptively tricking people into committing evil acts or driving a wedge between individuals.\n\nTheir hair and costume are both a part of their own flesh and when they engage in combat, the nails of their hand grow long and become terrifying sharp claws. However, their girlish appearance remains in order to assist in catching their opponents off guard.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"► Double Attack","description":"A Lilim can attack the same target twice in one action with its Claws."},{"title":"► Spiritualism Magic 5 Level/Magic Power 8 (15)","description":""},{"title":"◯ Magic Aptitude","description":"Lilim possesses the Combat Feat [ Metamagic/Targets ].\n2d |\nLoot |\nAlways |\nDaemon's Blood (100G/Red A) |\n2 - 8 |\nNothing |\n9+ |\nLovely Nails (250G/Red A) |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Lilim","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":200000}
{"_id":"xrXNLTmpk6QGp6fv","name":"Ezerve","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:ezerve","level":11,"monsterType":"Daemon","intelligence":"High","perception":"Five Senses (Darkvision)","disposition":"Hostile","soulscars":0,"languages":"Trade Common, Arcana, Drakish, Daemonic","habitat":"Ruins, Shallow Abysses","reputation":18,"weakness":22,"weakPoint":"Magic damage +2 points","initiative":18,"movementSpeed":"18","fortitude":"14 (21)","willpower":"14 (21)","source":"DL","description":"This Daemon is about 4 meters long and resembles a beautiful woman wearing a white cloak. Her hair and face are also white, while only the tip of her tail and her eyes are golden. The mantle is not a garment but skin that shimmers around her body like velvet.\n\nEzerves are rational and aggressive, preferring to work alone and not getting along with others. They can breathe a white substance that puts creatures into a state of suspended animation. The creature in this state is indistinguishable from a corpse, and after a funeral or other ceremony is held for it as if it were dead, the creature likes to cause despair by informing Humanoids of its true state.\n\nAdditionally, creatures put into suspended animation may be used as offerings for summoning other Daemons or as a Daemon Seminarium.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"◯ White Skin","description":"The physical and magical damage of the lightning and energy type is reduced by -3 points.\nHead"},{"title":"► Truespeech Magic 11 Level / Magic Power 14 (21)","description":""},{"title":"◯ Magic Aptitude","description":"They can use the Combat Feats [ Universal Metamagic ], [ Targeting ], [ Hawk Eye ], [ Magic Convergence ], [ Magic Control ], and [ Multi-Action ]."},{"title":"► Breath of Endless Sleep/Optional","description":"Spits white breath on up to 5 targets of Ezerve's choice within \"Range: Caster\", sapping life from them.\nThe targets are placed in a state of suspended animation and are treated as if no time has elapsed.\nA character in this state is indistinguishable from a corpse.\nIf the character knows about this ability (they have prior knowledge of the ability, or have successfully performed a Monster Knowledge check on this monster), they can perform a Detect check with Target Number 20 on a corpse that they strongly suspect is under this effect, and if successful, they can detect that the corpse is in a state of suspended animation under this effect.\nThis ability is treated as \"Resistance: Can't\" for targets with 0 or less HP.\nThis ability requires 10 minutes to use. It also consumes 30 MP when used.\nThis effect is treated as a poison and curse type with a Success Value of 20.\nBody"},{"title":"🗨 Flash of a Magic Blade","description":"Makes a Melee Attack against the target in the same skirmish area where this monster is located.\nThis effect cannot be performed on consecutive turns and costs 8 MP."},{"title":"◯ Painful Strike","description":"If the 2d roll of the damage roll is 10 or more, the damage is increased by an additional +9 points."},{"title":"◯ Attack Obstacle = +4 ・ +4","description":"The size of the head hinders attacks.\nThe Head section gained a +4 bonus to Evasion checks against melee attacks and ranged attacks.\nIf the HP of the Body section falls to 0 or below, it loses this ability.\nTail"},{"title":"◯ Sucking Needles/13 (20)/Fortitude/Negates","description":"If the Needles attack hits and deals 1 or more points of applied damage, the MP of all sections is restored by 5 points.\nIf the MP of a section is more than half of the maximum value, the MP of that section is not recovered."},{"title":"► Point Needle/13 (20)/Willpower/Half","description":"Throws a needle at the target character within \"Range: 10m\" and deals 2d+8 Curse magic damage. Using this effect consumes 5 MP.\n2d |\nLoot |\nAlways |\nCrystallized Daemon's Blood (800G/Red A) x 2 |\n2 - 6 |\nNothing |\n7 - 11 |\nWhite Membrane (2,500G/Red S) |\n12+ |\nMilky White Membrane (9,100G/Red S) |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Ezerve","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":300000}
{"_id":"y380qaP17gKwX02J","name":"Paryoma","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:paryoma","level":9,"monsterType":"Daemon","intelligence":"High","perception":"Magic","disposition":"Hostile","soulscars":0,"languages":"Arcana, Daemonic","habitat":"Shallows","reputation":16,"weakness":20,"weakPoint":"Bludgeoning-type damage +3 points","initiative":15,"movementSpeed":"12/-","fortitude":"12(19)","willpower":"12(19)","source":"AB, p. 124","description":"Paryoma is a humanoid Daemon about 5m in length, covered entirely in purple minerals. Its upper body is enlarged, with pointed crystals protruding from various parts as if growing out of its entire body. The lower body is small relative to its total length, only about human-sized, giving it an unbalanced appearance, but it has a tail thicker and longer than its legs which acts as support, allowing it to take a posture as if sitting on its own tail.\n\nThe minerals covering its entire body grow endlessly from within, and occasionally it shoots them like buckshot pellets to attack a wide area. At the same time, when the tail that supports its lower body is used for attacks, it swings it around like a blunt weapon held in long arms.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"◯Poison, Disease Immunity","description":""},{"title":"◯Ore Body","description":"Immunity to critical hits from edged weapons.\nUpper Body"},{"title":"◯Limited 2 Actions","description":"In addition to one melee attack as a Major Action, it can either use [►Buckshot Blast] once or cast one Spiritualism Magic spell."},{"title":"► Buckshot Blast / 10 (17) / Evasion / Negates","description":"Shoots multiple mineral fragments similar to Abyss Shards that can freely change trajectory. With \"Range: 1 (10m) / Shot ,\" deals 2d+8 points of physical damage to \"Target: 1 area (3m radius) / 5.\" This ability is treated as a thrown attack.\nWithin the Shallow Abyss, damage is increased by +2 points.\nThis ability cannot be used in consecutive turns."},{"title":"► Spiritualism Magic 8 Level / Magic Power 10 (17)","description":""},{"title":"◯🗨Magic Aptitude","description":"They can use Combat Feats [ Targeting ], [ Metamagic/Targets ], and [ Universal Metamagic ].\nLower Body"},{"title":"◯Attack Obstacle = +4 • None","description":"Size hinders attacks.\nThe Upper Body section gains a +4 bonus to Evasion against melee attacks. This effect is lost if the Lower Body section's HP falls below 0."},{"title":"🗨Tail Sweep","description":"Choose up to 3 characters capable of melee attack and perform a Tail attack against them. Accuracy check is performed once for all targets, and if multiple hits land, damage is determined individually.\nThis ability cannot be used in consecutive turns."},{"title":"⏩Buckshot Loading","description":"Generates ore from both Upper Body and Lower Body for shooting. For 10 seconds (1 round), grants a +1 bonus to Upper Body section's [►Buckshot Blast] Accuracy check and increases damage by +4 points.\nDuring the effect duration, Defense decreases by 3 points.\n2d |\nLoot |\nAlways |\nDaemon's Blood (100G/Red A) x 1d |\nAlways |\nCrystallized Daemon's Blood (800G/Red A) |\n2 - 7 |\nNothing |\n8 - 11 |\nAbyss Shard (200G/-) x 1d |\n12+ |\nAbyss Shard (200G/-) x 2d |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Paryoma","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":400000}
